    效果说明: "构图笔记：中间宽上下窄的「下扩」比单一直线透视更近大远小，底部张开自带冲出画面的动势。\n能怎么改：CSS 变形做不出平滑梯形（切缝必错位），demo 用 canvas 逐行扫描线按线性插值缩放；st/sb 分别控制顶/底宽度，st<1<sb 即下扩，反转即上收。",
    用法: "运动品牌标题、活动大字报：文字逐行渐变缩放，形成中间宽、上下窄的底部张开透视。",
    提示词: "做一行文字的梯形下扩透视变形，中间宽上下窄，呈现近大远小的底部张开效果。\n要求（纯 HTML/CSS/JS，零依赖）：把文字画进离屏 canvas，再逐横行 drawImage、宽度按 st→sb 线性插值（两段式 scaleX 会在切缝错位，必须逐行）；关键参数：st 顶部缩放 / sb 底部缩放 / fs 字号 / fw 字重 / c 文字色 / page 页面背景 / ls 字距 / txt 文案。参考实现：assets/demos/梯形下扩变形.html",
    代码: "\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<!-- M175 梯形下扩透视变形：canvas 逐行扫描线缩放，0.72→1.22 线性过渡出平滑梯形（file:// 可直接开，零依赖） -->\\n<html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n<style>\\n  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\\n  body{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--page)}\\n  canvas{display:block}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <canvas id=\\\"cv\\\"></canvas>\\n<script>\\n  const state={st:0.72,sb:1.22,fs:80,fw:800,c:'#151b2e',page:'#eef1f6',ls:4,txt:'SPEED'};\\n  const cv=document.getElementById('cv');\\n  function apply(){\\n    document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--page',state.page);\\n    // 文本先画到离屏 canvas，再逐行 drawImage 按线性插值宽度重排——\\n    // 两段式 scaleX 在切缝处必然错位，逐行才是真「近大远小」\\n    const off=document.createElement('canvas');\\n    const mc=off.getContext('2d');\\n    const font=state.fw+' '+state.fs+'px system-ui,\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif';\\n    mc.font=font;\\n    const pad=12, h=Math.ceil(state.fs*1.4);\\n    const w=Math.ceil(mc.measureText(state.txt).width+state.ls*(state.txt.length-1))+pad*2;\\n    off.width=w; off.height=h;\\n    mc.font=font; mc.fillStyle=state.c; mc.textBaseline='middle';\\n    let x=pad;\\n    for(const ch of state.txt){mc.fillText(ch,x,h/2);x+=mc.measureText(ch).width+state.ls;}\\n    const maxS=Math.max(state.st,state.sb,1);\\n    cv.width=Math.ceil(w*maxS); cv.height=h;\\n    const ctx=cv.getContext('2d');\\n    ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled=false;\\n    for(let y=0;y<h;y++){\\n      const s=state.st+(state.sb-state.st)*(y/(h-1));\\n      const dw=w*s;\\n      ctx.drawImage(off,0,y,w,1,(cv.width-dw)/2,y,dw,1);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data||{};if(d.type!=='param'||!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\\n  apply();\\n<\\/script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\"",
