{"id":"M183","标题":"重叠排列","适配端":"通用","元素":"容器布局","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["卡片","层叠","列表"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/重叠排列.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#4f46e5"},{"键":"c2","名":"卡片底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef0f4"},{"键":"gap","名":"卡片间距","类型":"slider","最小":6,"最大":40,"步长":1,"默认":16},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":32,"步长":1,"默认":16},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":16},{"键":"w","名":"宽度","类型":"slider","最小":180,"最大":420,"步长":5,"默认":300}],"效果说明":"多张内容卡片在垂直方向互相错开叠放，鼠标悬停时中间那张抬起放大、上下两张让位，形成有层级的堆叠列表。适合做消息流、待办、相册预览。","用法":"详情页调主色 c1、卡片底色 c2、间距 gap、圆角 rad；hover 的位移与旋转写在 CSS 里，想换形态改 .stack:hover 那三行。","提示词":"用零依赖单文件 HTML 做一个垂直堆叠的卡片列表：3 张卡片错开叠放并轻微旋转，鼠标悬停时中间卡片上浮放大、上下两张向两侧让位。用 CSS 变量控制主色、底色、间距、圆角，system-ui 字体，375px 下不溢出。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>重叠排列</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#4f46e5;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#eef0f4;--gap:16px;--rad:16px;--pad:16px;--w:300px;--h:120px;--sp:1;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.stack{position:relative;width:min(90vw,var(--w));height:calc(var(--h) * 3 + var(--gap) * 2);transform:scale(var(--sp));transform-origin:center}\\\\n.card{position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;height:var(--h);background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:var(--pad);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(20,20,40,.12);border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.05);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),box-shadow .35s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\\\n.card .dot{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c1);flex:0 0 auto}\\\\n.card .t{font-weight:600}\\\\n.card .s{font-size:13px;opacity:.6}\\\\n.card:nth-child(1){top:0;transform:translateY(0) rotate(-2deg)}\\\\n.card:nth-child(2){top:calc(var(--h) + var(--gap));transform:translateY(0)}\\\\n.card:nth-child(3){top:calc((var(--h) + var(--gap)) * 2);transform:translateY(0) rotate(2deg)}\\\\n.stack:hover .card:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(-12px) rotate(-3deg)}\\\\n.stack:hover .card:nth-child(2){transform:translateY(0) scale(1.04);z-index:3;box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(20,20,40,.2)}\\\\n.stack:hover .card:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(12px) rotate(3deg)}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"stack\\\\\\\">\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"card\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"dot\\\\\\\"></span><div><div class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">设计稿 v3</div><div class=\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\">2 小时前更新</div></div></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"card\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"dot\\\\\\\"></span><div><div class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">需求评审</div><div class=\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\">今天 14:00</div></div></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"card\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"dot\\\\\\\"></span><div><div class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">上线清单</div><div class=\\\\\\\"s\\\\\\\">共 8 项</div></div></div>\\\\n</div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#4f46e5\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#eef0f4\\\\\\\",gap:16,rad:16,pad:16,w:300,h:120,sp:1};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');r.setProperty('--h',state.h+'px');r.setProperty('--sp',state.sp);}\\\\napply();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
