{"id":"M184","标题":"进度底色","适配端":"通用","元素":"反馈","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["进度","底色","列表"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/进度底色.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#4f46e5"},{"键":"c2","名":"卡片底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef0f4"},{"键":"gap","名":"行间距","类型":"slider","最小":6,"最大":30,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":16},{"键":"p","名":"进度值","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":100,"步长":1,"默认":62}],"效果说明":"每列表项背后有一层半透明主色填充表示完成度，文字压在填充之上，一眼看出各项进度。适合打卡、任务完成度、评分。","用法":"调 p 改首行进度；fill 的宽度用 width:calc(var(--p)*1%) 驱动，其它行写死百分比演示不同进度。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：一个列表，每行背后有一层半透明主色填充表示进度百分比，文字压在填充之上。用 CSS 变量控制主色、底色、圆角，进度由 --p 驱动，system-ui 字体。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>进度底色</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#4f46e5;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#eef0f4;--gap:14px;--rad:14px;--pad:16px;--w:320px;--h:64px;--p:62;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.list{width:min(92vw,var(--w));display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--gap)}\\\\n.row{position:relative;height:var(--h);background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:0 var(--pad);display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(20,20,40,.08)}\\\\n.fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:calc(var(--p) * 1%);background:var(--c1);opacity:.16;transition:width .3s}\\\\n.row .lab{position:relative;font-weight:600}\\\\n.row .val{position:relative;margin-left:auto;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;opacity:.7}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"list\\\\\\\">\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"row\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"fill\\\\\\\"></div><span class=\\\\\\\"lab\\\\\\\">阅读</span><span class=\\\\\\\"val\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"v\\\\\\\">62%</span></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"row\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"fill\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"width:38%\\\\\\\"></div><span class=\\\\\\\"lab\\\\\\\">运动</span><span class=\\\\\\\"val\\\\\\\">38%</span></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"row\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"fill\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"width:81%\\\\\\\"></div><span class=\\\\\\\"lab\\\\\\\">编码</span><span class=\\\\\\\"val\\\\\\\">81%</span></div>\\\\n</div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#4f46e5\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#eef0f4\\\\\\\",gap:14,rad:14,pad:16,w:320,h:64,p:62};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');r.setProperty('--h',state.h+'px');r.setProperty('--p',state.p);document.getElementById('v').textContent=state.p+'%';}\\\\napply();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
