{"id":"M185","标题":"横向手风琴","适配端":"通用","元素":"导航","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["手风琴","横向","导航"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/横向手风琴.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#0ea5e9"},{"键":"c2","名":"面板底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef0f4"},{"键":"gap","名":"面板间距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":24,"步长":1,"默认":10},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":16},{"键":"w","名":"宽度","类型":"slider","最小":220,"最大":460,"步长":5,"默认":340},{"键":"h","名":"高度","类型":"slider","最小":120,"最大":280,"步长":5,"默认":200}],"效果说明":"几个面板横向并排，点击其中一个它展开变宽、其余压缩，标题在展开态从竖排转横排。适合功能模块切换、图片画廊。","用法":"点击切换 .on 类；flex 在 CSS 里控制展开比例（.pan.on{flex:4}），想改列数直接加 .pan 元素。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：横向排列的面板手风琴，点击某面板它 flex 展开、其余压缩，标题在展开态由竖排变横排。CSS 变量控制主色、圆角、宽高，点击用 JS 切 .on 类。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>横向手风琴</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#0ea5e9;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#0f172a;--bg:#eef0f4;--gap:10px;--rad:16px;--w:340px;--h:200px;--sp:1;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.acc{display:flex;gap:var(--gap);width:min(94vw,var(--w));height:var(--h);transform:scale(var(--sp))}\\\\n.pan{flex:1;background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);overflow:hidden;transition:flex .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);cursor:pointer;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:14px;color:var(--c3);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(20,20,40,.1)}\\\\n.pan::before{content:\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--c1);opacity:.14}\\\\n.pan .t{position:relative;font-weight:700;writing-mode:vertical-rl;transition:writing-mode .3s}\\\\n.pan.on{flex:4}\\\\n.pan.on .t{writing-mode:horizontal-tb}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"acc\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"acc\\\\\\\">\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"pan on\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">概览</span></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"pan\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">数据</span></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"pan\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">设置</span></div>\\\\n</div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#0ea5e9\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#eef0f4\\\\\\\",gap:10,rad:16,w:340,h:200,sp:1};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');r.setProperty('--h',state.h+'px');r.setProperty('--sp',state.sp);}\\\\napply();\\\\nconst pans=document.querySelectorAll('.pan');\\\\npans.forEach(p=>p.addEventListener('click',()=>{pans.forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('on'));p.classList.add('on');}));\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
