{"id":"M186","标题":"组件托盘","适配端":"通用","元素":"导航","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["托盘","Dock","图标"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/组件托盘.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"图标色","类型":"color","默认":"#6366f1"},{"键":"c2","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"辅助文字","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":8,"最大":30,"步长":1,"默认":18},{"键":"sz","名":"图标尺寸","类型":"slider","最小":36,"最大":72,"步长":1,"默认":52},{"键":"mag","名":"放大倍数","类型":"slider","最小":1,"最大":2.4,"步长":0.1,"默认":1.6},{"键":"w","名":"宽度","类型":"slider","最小":240,"最大":460,"步长":5,"默认":360}],"效果说明":"底部一排图标托盘（类似 macOS Dock），光标靠近的图标放大、相邻图标轻微跟随放大，离开复原。适合工具栏、快捷操作区。","用法":"mousemove 算光标到每个图标中心的距离，距离越近 scale 越大；mag 控制最大放大倍数，sz 控制基础尺寸。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：底部一排图标 Dock，光标靠近的图标放大、相邻图标轻微跟随放大，离开复原。用 CSS 变量控制图标色、尺寸、放大倍数，mousemove 计算距离驱动 transform:scale。","代码":"\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><title>组件托盘</title>\\n<style>\\n:root{--c1:#6366f1;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#0f172a;--rad:18px;--w:360px;--h:96px;--sz:52px;--mag:1.6;}\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Roboto,\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c2);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\n.dock{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;height:var(--h);padding:0 10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:var(--rad);backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}\\n.ic{width:var(--sz);height:var(--sz);border-radius:14px;background:var(--c1);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--c2);font-weight:800;transition:transform .15s;transform-origin:bottom center;cursor:pointer;user-select:none}\\n</style></head><body>\\n<div class=\\\"dock\\\" id=\\\"dock\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"ic\\\">A</div><div class=\\\"ic\\\">B</div><div class=\\\"ic\\\">C</div><div class=\\\"ic\\\">D</div><div class=\\\"ic\\\">E</div>\\n</div>\\n<script>\\nconst state={c1:\\\"#6366f1\\\",c2:\\\"#ffffff\\\",c3:\\\"#1f2937\\\",bg:\\\"#0f172a\\\",rad:18,w:360,h:96,sz:52,mag:1.6};\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');r.setProperty('--h',state.h+'px');r.setProperty('--sz',state.sz+'px');r.setProperty('--mag',state.mag);}\\napply();\\nconst dock=document.getElementById('dock');\\ndock.addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{[...dock.children].forEach(ic=>{const b=ic.getBoundingClientRect();const c=b.left+b.width/2;const d=Math.abs(e.clientX-c);const s=Math.max(1,1+(state.mag-1)*(1-Math.min(d,120)/120));ic.style.transform='scale('+s.toFixed(3)+')';});});\\ndock.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>[...dock.children].forEach(ic=>ic.style.transform='scale(1)'));\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\n<\\/script></body></html>\\n\""}
