{"id":"M187","标题":"跟手放大图标","适配端":"通用","元素":"动效","风格":"科技未来","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["放大","光标","动效"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/跟手放大图标.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"图标色","类型":"color","默认":"#7c3aed"},{"键":"c2","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"辅助文字","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef0f4"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":8,"最大":40,"步长":1,"默认":24},{"键":"sz","名":"图标尺寸","类型":"slider","最小":48,"最大":120,"步长":2,"默认":84},{"键":"mag","名":"放大倍数","类型":"slider","最小":1,"最大":3,"步长":0.1,"默认":1.8},{"键":"maxd","名":"感应半径","类型":"slider","最小":60,"最大":260,"步长":5,"默认":160}],"效果说明":"一个大图标，光标越靠近它放得越大，离开则缩回，像被光标“吸”住。适合主操作按钮、强调入口。","用法":"mousemove/touchmove 算光标到图标中心距离，距离小于 maxd 时按比例放大；mag 控制最大倍率。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：中央一个大圆角图标，光标越靠近放大越多、离开缩回，带有跟手吸附感。CSS 变量控制图标色、尺寸、放大倍数与感应半径，指针距离驱动 scale。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>跟手放大图标</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#7c3aed;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#eef0f4;--rad:24px;--sz:84px;--mag:1.8;--maxd:160;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.stage{position:relative;width:min(90vw,320px);height:260px;display:grid;place-items:center;touch-action:none}\\\\n.big{width:var(--sz);height:var(--sz);border-radius:var(--rad);background:var(--c1);color:var(--c2);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;transition:transform .08s linear;will-change:transform}\\\\n.hint{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;opacity:.5}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"stage\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"stage\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"big\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"big\\\\\\\">★</div><div class=\\\\\\\"hint\\\\\\\">把光标靠近图标，它会跟着放大</div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#7c3aed\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#eef0f4\\\\\\\",rad:24,sz:84,mag:1.8,maxd:160};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--sz',state.sz+'px');r.setProperty('--mag',state.mag);r.setProperty('--maxd',state.maxd);}\\\\napply();\\\\nconst stage=document.getElementById('stage'),big=document.getElementById('big');\\\\nfunction move(e){const b=big.getBoundingClientRect();const cx=b.left+b.width/2,cy=b.top+b.height/2;const x=(e.touches?e.touches[0].clientX:e.clientX),y=(e.touches?e.touches[0].clientY:e.clientY);const d=Math.hypot(x-cx,y-cy);const s=1+Math.max(0,(1-Math.min(d,state.maxd)/state.maxd))*(state.mag-1);big.style.transform='scale('+s.toFixed(3)+')';}\\\\nstage.addEventListener('mousemove',move);stage.addEventListener('touchmove',move,{passive:true});\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
