{"id":"M188","标题":"下拉摘要","适配端":"通用","元素":"容器布局","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["下拉","折叠","摘要"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/下拉摘要.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"强调色","类型":"color","默认":"#059669"},{"键":"c2","名":"卡片底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef0f4"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":16},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":16},{"键":"w","名":"宽度","类型":"slider","最小":220,"最大":460,"步长":5,"默认":340}],"效果说明":"一个标题栏，点击展开/收起一段摘要文字，箭头随状态旋转。适合 FAQ、卡片详情、公告。","用法":"点击切 .on 类；.body 用 max-height 过渡实现展开收起，箭头旋转写在 .item.on .hd .ar。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：可点击展开/收起的摘要卡片，标题栏带箭头，展开时箭头旋转、正文用 max-height 过渡滑出。CSS 变量控制强调色、边框、圆角。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>下拉摘要</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#059669;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#eef0f4;--bd:#e5e7eb;--rad:16px;--pad:16px;--w:340px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.item{width:min(92vw,var(--w));background:var(--c2);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:var(--rad);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,20,40,.08);overflow:hidden}\\\\n.hd{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:var(--pad);cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:var(--c3)}\\\\n.hd .ar{margin-left:auto;color:var(--c1);transition:transform .3s}\\\\n.item.on .hd .ar{transform:rotate(180deg)}\\\\n.body{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .35s ease;padding:0 var(--pad)}\\\\n.item.on .body{max-height:220px}\\\\n.body p{padding-bottom:var(--pad);opacity:.7;line-height:1.6}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"item on\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\">\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"hd\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"hd\\\\\\\">本周小结 <span class=\\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\">▾</span></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"body\\\\\\\"><p>完成 12 项任务，比上周多 3 项；运动打卡 5 天，阅读累计 4.2 小时。下周重点是把「组件库」整理完。</p></div>\\\\n</div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#059669\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#eef0f4\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",rad:16,pad:16,w:340};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');}\\\\napply();\\\\ndocument.getElementById('hd').addEventListener('click',()=>document.getElementById('item').classList.toggle('on'));\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
