{"id":"M189","标题":"滑动标尺","适配端":"通用","元素":"输入","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["标尺","滑块","输入"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/滑动标尺.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"滑块底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"sz","名":"手柄尺寸","类型":"slider","最小":20,"最大":40,"步长":1,"默认":28},{"键":"val","名":"当前值","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":100,"步长":1,"默认":46},{"键":"w","名":"宽度","类型":"slider","最小":220,"最大":460,"步长":5,"默认":340}],"效果说明":"带刻度线的滑轨，圆点手柄可拖动，上方实时显示数值，像一把尺子。适合身高体重、音量、强度等连续量输入。","用法":"pointer 事件算手柄位置映射成 0–100 的 val；ticks 用 JS 生成 11 根刻度，想改量纲把 val 当百分比再换算显示。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：带刻度线的水平滑块，可拖动圆点手柄，上方实时显示当前值。用 CSS 变量控制主色、手柄尺寸，pointer 事件映射位置为数值，system-ui 字体。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>滑动标尺</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--rad:14px;--w:340px;--h:14px;--sz:28px;--val:46;--min:0;--max:100;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(92vw,var(--w));background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:34px 18px 22px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,20,40,.08)}\\\\n.slider{position:relative;height:64px;margin-top:6px;touch-action:none}\\\\n.ticks{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:30px;height:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;pointer-events:none}\\\\n.ticks i{flex:0 0 1px;background:#c7c7cc;height:9px}\\\\n.track{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:24px;height:var(--h);background:#d1d1d6;border-radius:999px}\\\\n.fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:24px;height:var(--h);background:var(--c1);border-radius:999px;width:calc(var(--val) * 1%)}\\\\n.hd{position:absolute;top:24px;width:var(--sz);height:var(--sz);border-radius:50%;background:var(--c2);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transform:translate(-50%,-7px);left:calc(var(--val) * 1%);cursor:grab}\\\\n.val{position:absolute;top:-4px;left:calc(var(--val) * 1%);transform:translateX(-50%);font-weight:700;color:var(--c1);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"slider\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"slider\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"ticks\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"ticks\\\\\\\"></div><div class=\\\\\\\"track\\\\\\\"></div><div class=\\\\\\\"fill\\\\\\\"></div><div class=\\\\\\\"val\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"val\\\\\\\">46</div><div class=\\\\\\\"hd\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"hd\\\\\\\"></div></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",rad:14,w:340,h:14,sz:28,val:46,min:0,max:100};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');r.setProperty('--h',state.h+'px');r.setProperty('--sz',state.sz+'px');r.setProperty('--val',state.val);r.setProperty('--min',state.min);r.setProperty('--max',state.max);document.getElementById('val').textContent=state.val;}\\\\nconst ticks=document.getElementById('ticks');for(let i=0;i<=10;i++)ticks.appendChild(document.createElement('i'));\\\\napply();\\\\nconst slider=document.getElementById('slider');let drag=false;\\\\nfunction setVal(x){const b=slider.getBoundingClientRect();let p=(x-b.left)/b.width*100;p=Math.max(state.min,Math.min(state.max,p));state.val=Math.round(p);apply();}\\\\nslider.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{drag=true;slider.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);setVal(e.clientX);});\\\\nslider.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(drag)setVal(e.clientX);});\\\\nslider.addEventListener('pointerup',()=>drag=false);\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
