{"id":"M191","标题":"步进器","适配端":"通用","元素":"输入","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["步进","加减","输入"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/步进器.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#d1d1d6"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"n","名":"当前值","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":3},{"键":"max","名":"最大值","类型":"slider","最小":1,"最大":30,"步长":1,"默认":10}],"效果说明":"“− 数字 +”的计数器，加减改变数值并在上下限处禁用按钮。适合数量、页数、票数等离散量。","用法":"点击 ± 改 state.n 并夹在 min/max 之间；到边界时 disabled 按钮，cap 显示范围。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：圆角边框的步进器，−/+ 按钮改变中间数字，到上下限禁用对应按钮。CSS 变量控制主色、边框、圆角，点击改数值并钳制范围。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>步进器</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#d1d1d6;--rad:14px;--n:3;--min:0;--max:10;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:28px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,20,40,.08);text-align:center}\\\\n.step{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:var(--rad);overflow:hidden;background:var(--c2)}\\\\n.step button{width:52px;height:52px;border:0;background:var(--c2);color:var(--c1);font-size:26px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}\\\\n.step button:disabled{color:#c7c7cc}\\\\n.step .num{width:72px;text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\\\\n.cap{margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;opacity:.6}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"step\\\\\\\"><button id=\\\\\\\"minus\\\\\\\">−</button><span class=\\\\\\\"num\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"num\\\\\\\">3</span><button id=\\\\\\\"plus\\\\\\\">+</button></div><div class=\\\\\\\"cap\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"cap\\\\\\\">数量 0 – 10</div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#d1d1d6\\\\\\\",rad:14,n:3,min:0,max:10};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--n',state.n);r.setProperty('--min',state.min);r.setProperty('--max',state.max);document.getElementById('num').textContent=state.n;document.getElementById('minus').disabled=state.n<=state.min;document.getElementById('plus').disabled=state.n>=state.max;document.getElementById('cap').textContent='数量 '+state.min+' – '+state.max;}\\\\napply();\\\\ndocument.getElementById('minus').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(state.n>state.min){state.n--;apply();}});\\\\ndocument.getElementById('plus').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(state.n<state.max){state.n++;apply();}});\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
