{"id":"M192","标题":"级联选择器","适配端":"通用","元素":"输入","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["级联","选择","省市区"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/省市区级联.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#d1d1d6"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":12},{"键":"w","名":"宽度","类型":"slider","最小":220,"最大":460,"步长":5,"默认":340}],"效果说明":"省→市→区三级联动下拉，选上级后下级选项自动刷新，底部显示完整路径。适合地址、分类树。","用法":"DATA 对象存三级映射，change 时重填下级 select 并刷新底部路径；换数据只需改 DATA。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：省/市/区三级级联选择器，选上级后下级选项自动刷新，底部显示完整路径。CSS 变量控制主色、边框、圆角，原生 select 即可。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>级联选择器</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#d1d1d6;--rad:12px;--w:340px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(92vw,var(--w));background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,20,40,.08)}\\\\n.cas{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\\\n.sel{position:relative}\\\\n.cas select{width:100%;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:var(--rad);background:var(--c2);color:var(--c3);font:inherit;outline:none}\\\\n.cas select:focus{border-color:var(--c1)}\\\\n.out{margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;opacity:.65;text-align:center}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"cas\\\\\\\">\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"sel\\\\\\\"><select id=\\\\\\\"p\\\\\\\"></select></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"sel\\\\\\\"><select id=\\\\\\\"c\\\\\\\"></select></div>\\\\n <div class=\\\\\\\"sel\\\\\\\"><select id=\\\\\\\"d\\\\\\\"></select></div>\\\\n</div><div class=\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"out\\\\\\\"></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#d1d1d6\\\\\\\",rad:12,w:340};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');}\\\\napply();\\\\nconst DATA={北京:{朝阳区:[\\\\\\\"三里屯\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"望京\\\\\\\"],海淀区:[\\\\\\\"中关村\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"五道口\\\\\\\"]},上海:{浦东新区:[\\\\\\\"陆家嘴\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"张江\\\\\\\"],徐汇区:[\\\\\\\"徐家汇\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"漕河泾\\\\\\\"]}};\\\\nconst p=document.getElementById('p'),c=document.getElementById('c'),d=document.getElementById('d'),out=document.getElementById('out');\\\\nfunction fill(sel,arr){sel.innerHTML='';arr.forEach(v=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=v;o.textContent=v;sel.appendChild(o);});}\\\\nfunction sync(){const city=DATA[p.value];fill(c,Object.keys(city));const dist=city[c.value];fill(d,dist);out.textContent=p.value+' / '+c.value+' / '+d.value;}\\\\np.addEventListener('change',sync);c.addEventListener('change',sync);\\\\nfill(p,Object.keys(DATA));sync();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
