{"id":"M193","标题":"日期范围选择器","适配端":"通用","元素":"输入","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["日期","范围","日历"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/日期范围选择器.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#d1d1d6"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":12},{"键":"w","名":"宽度","类型":"slider","最小":220,"最大":460,"步长":5,"默认":340},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":6,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":14}],"效果说明":"两个日期输入框之间一个“至”字，选好起止后自动算出相隔天数，且结束不会早于开始。适合酒店、请假、预订。","用法":"change 时算相差天数并钳制 b>=a（若颠倒则交换）；天数 = (b-a)/864e5 + 1。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：两个原生 date 输入框配“至”字，选好起止自动算相隔天数且结束不早于开始。CSS 变量控制主色、边框、圆角。","代码":"\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><title>日期范围选择器</title>\\n<style>\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#d1d1d6;--rad:12px;--w:340px;--pad:14px;}\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Roboto,\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\n.box{width:min(94vw,360px);background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,20,40,.08)}\\n.dr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\\n.dr input{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:var(--pad);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:var(--rad);background:var(--c2);color:var(--c3);font:inherit;outline:none}\\n.dr input:focus{border-color:var(--c1)}\\n.dr span{opacity:.5}\\n.out{margin-top:14px;text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--c1)}\\n</style></head><body>\\n<div class=\\\"box\\\"><div class=\\\"dr\\\"><input type=\\\"date\\\" id=\\\"a\\\" value=\\\"2026-09-20\\\"><span>至</span><input type=\\\"date\\\" id=\\\"b\\\" value=\\\"2026-09-24\\\"></div><div class=\\\"out\\\" id=\\\"out\\\">共 4 天</div></div>\\n<script>\\nconst state={c1:\\\"#007aff\\\",c2:\\\"#ffffff\\\",c3:\\\"#1f2937\\\",bg:\\\"#f2f2f7\\\",bd:\\\"#d1d1d6\\\",rad:12,w:340,pad:14};\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');}\\napply();\\nconst a=document.getElementById('a'),b=document.getElementById('b'),out=document.getElementById('out');\\nfunction diff(){let d0=new Date(a.value),d1=new Date(b.value);if(isNaN(d0)||isNaN(d1)){out.textContent='请选择日期';return;}if(d1<d0){const t=a.value;a.value=b.value;b.value=t;d0=new Date(a.value);d1=new Date(b.value);}const n=Math.round((d1-d0)/864e5)+1;out.textContent='共 '+n+' 天';}\\na.addEventListener('change',diff);b.addEventListener('change',diff);diff();\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\n<\\/script></body></html>\\n\""}
