{"id":"M194","标题":"活动圆环","适配端":"通用","元素":"数据","风格":"暗色","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["圆环","进度","活动"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/活动圆环.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"环1色","类型":"color","默认":"#ff375f"},{"键":"c2","名":"环2色","类型":"color","默认":"#a8ff00"},{"键":"c3","名":"环3色","类型":"color","默认":"#00e0ff"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"p1","名":"环1进度","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":100,"步长":1,"默认":72},{"键":"p2","名":"环2进度","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":100,"步长":1,"默认":54},{"键":"p3","名":"环3进度","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":100,"步长":1,"默认":88},{"键":"lw","名":"环宽","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":22,"步长":1,"默认":12}],"效果说明":"三个同心圆环像运动手表的活动环，分别用 dasharray 表示完成度，起点在顶部。适合多指标达成率。","用法":"ring() 用周长*（1-进度/100）算 dashoffset；想加环复制一组 circle 并在 ring() 里加一行。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML（深色背景）：三个同心圆环表示多项达成率，用 stroke-dasharray/offset 控制进度，起点在顶部。CSS 变量控制三环颜色、环宽、背景。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>活动圆环</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#ff375f;--c2:#a8ff00;--c3:#00e0ff;--bg:#0f172a;--p1:72;--p2:54;--p3:88;--lw:12;--sz:200;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:#e5e7eb;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.wrap{width:min(86vw,var(--sz));aspect-ratio:1}\\\\nsvg{width:100%;height:100%;transform:rotate(-90deg)}\\\\ncircle{fill:none;stroke-width:var(--lw);stroke-linecap:round}\\\\n.track{stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"wrap\\\\\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\\\\\"0 0 120 120\\\\\\\">\\\\n <circle class=\\\\\\\"track\\\\\\\" cx=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" cy=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" r=\\\\\\\"50\\\\\\\"/><circle id=\\\\\\\"r1\\\\\\\" cx=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" cy=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" r=\\\\\\\"50\\\\\\\" stroke=\\\\\\\"var(--c1)\\\\\\\"/>\\\\n <circle class=\\\\\\\"track\\\\\\\" cx=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" cy=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" r=\\\\\\\"36\\\\\\\"/><circle id=\\\\\\\"r2\\\\\\\" cx=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" cy=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" r=\\\\\\\"36\\\\\\\" stroke=\\\\\\\"var(--c2)\\\\\\\"/>\\\\n <circle class=\\\\\\\"track\\\\\\\" cx=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" cy=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" r=\\\\\\\"22\\\\\\\"/><circle id=\\\\\\\"r3\\\\\\\" cx=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" cy=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" r=\\\\\\\"22\\\\\\\" stroke=\\\\\\\"var(--c3)\\\\\\\"/>\\\\n</svg></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst C=2*Math.PI;\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#ff375f\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#a8ff00\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#00e0ff\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",p1:72,p2:54,p3:88,lw:12,sz:200};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction ring(el,p,rad){const c=C*rad;el.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray',c+' '+(c*2));el.setAttribute('stroke-dashoffset',(c*(1-p/100)).toFixed(2));}\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--lw',state.lw+'px');r.setProperty('--sz',state.sz+'px');ring(document.getElementById('r1'),state.p1,50);ring(document.getElementById('r2'),state.p2,36);ring(document.getElementById('r3'),state.p3,22);}\\\\napply();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
