{"id":"M195","标题":"打卡热力格","适配端":"通用","元素":"数据","风格":"暗色","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["热力","网格","打卡"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/打卡热力格.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"激活色","类型":"color","默认":"#2563eb"},{"键":"c2","名":"空格色","类型":"color","默认":"#334155"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"cols","名":"列数","类型":"slider","最小":8,"最大":26,"步长":1,"默认":18},{"键":"gap","名":"格间距","类型":"slider","最小":2,"最大":10,"步长":1,"默认":4},{"键":"cell","名":"格尺寸","类型":"slider","最小":8,"最大":22,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"rad","名":"格圆角","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":8,"步长":1,"默认":3}],"效果说明":"GitHub 风格的一格格方块矩阵，颜色越深代表当天活跃度越高，悬停看数值。适合打卡、贡献、活跃。","用法":"JS 按 7 行×cols 列生成格子，value>0.04 时填主色并按强度设 opacity；换数据改 val() 的伪随机或接真实数据。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML（深色背景）：GitHub 风格打卡热力矩阵，7 行 N 列小格子，活跃度越高颜色越深。CSS 变量控制激活色、空格色、列数、格间距。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>打卡热力格</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#2563eb;--c2:#334155;--c3:#e5e7eb;--bg:#0f172a;--cols:18;--gap:4px;--cell:14px;--rad:3px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(94vw,520px)}\\\\n.grid{display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-template-rows:repeat(7,var(--cell));gap:var(--gap)}\\\\n.cell{width:var(--cell);height:var(--cell);border-radius:var(--rad);background:var(--c2)}\\\\n.cap{margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;opacity:.6;text-align:center}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"grid\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"grid\\\\\\\"></div><div class=\\\\\\\"cap\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"cap\\\\\\\"></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#2563eb\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#334155\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",cols:18,gap:4,cell:14,rad:3};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction val(i){const x=Math.sin(i*12.9898)*43758.5453;return Math.abs(x-Math.floor(x));}\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--cols',state.cols);r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--cell',state.cell+'px');r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');const g=document.getElementById('grid');g.innerHTML='';let sum=0;for(let i=0;i<7*state.cols;i++){const v=val(i);sum+=Math.round(v*4);const c=document.createElement('div');c.className='cell';if(v>.04){c.style.background='var(--c1)';c.style.opacity=v.toFixed(2);}g.appendChild(c);}document.getElementById('cap').textContent='近 '+state.cols+' 周共打卡 '+sum+' 次';}\\\\napply();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
