{"id":"M196","标题":"半圆仪表盘","适配端":"通用","元素":"数据","风格":"科技未来","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["仪表盘","半圆","指标"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/半圆仪表盘.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"弧色","类型":"color","默认":"#22d3ee"},{"键":"c2","名":"轨道色","类型":"color","默认":"#334155"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"val","名":"当前值","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":100,"步长":1,"默认":64},{"键":"lw","名":"弧宽","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":26,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"sz","名":"尺寸","类型":"slider","最小":140,"最大":300,"步长":5,"默认":220}],"效果说明":"上半圆弧形仪表，已走部分用亮色填充，中心一根指针随数值转动，中间显示数字。适合速率、完成度、负荷。","用法":"弧用半圆 path 的 dashoffset 表示进度；指针 angle=-90+val/100*180 绕圆心旋转；改 val 实时更新。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML（深色背景）：半圆仪表盘，亮色弧表示进度、中心指针随数值转动、中间显示数字。CSS 变量控制弧色、弧宽、背景。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>半圆仪表盘</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#22d3ee;--c2:#334155;--c3:#e5e7eb;--bg:#0f172a;--val:64;--lw:14;--sz:220;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.wrap{width:min(86vw,var(--sz))}\\\\nsvg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\\\\n.track{fill:none;stroke:var(--c2);stroke-width:var(--lw);stroke-linecap:round}\\\\n.arc{fill:none;stroke:var(--c1);stroke-width:var(--lw);stroke-linecap:round}\\\\n.needle{stroke:var(--c3);stroke-width:3;stroke-linecap:round}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"wrap\\\\\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\\\\\"0 0 200 120\\\\\\\">\\\\n <path class=\\\\\\\"track\\\\\\\" d=\\\\\\\"M10 105 A90 90 0 0 1 190 105\\\\\\\"/>\\\\n <path id=\\\\\\\"arc\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"arc\\\\\\\" d=\\\\\\\"M10 105 A90 90 0 0 1 190 105\\\\\\\"/>\\\\n <line id=\\\\\\\"needle\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"needle\\\\\\\" x1=\\\\\\\"100\\\\\\\" y1=\\\\\\\"105\\\\\\\" x2=\\\\\\\"100\\\\\\\" y2=\\\\\\\"25\\\\\\\"/>\\\\n <text id=\\\\\\\"vt\\\\\\\" x=\\\\\\\"100\\\\\\\" y=\\\\\\\"98\\\\\\\" text-anchor=\\\\\\\"middle\\\\\\\" fill=\\\\\\\"var(--c3)\\\\\\\" font-size=\\\\\\\"22\\\\\\\" font-weight=\\\\\\\"700\\\\\\\">64</text>\\\\n</svg></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst L=Math.PI*90;\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#22d3ee\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#334155\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",val:64,lw:14,sz:220};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--lw',state.lw+'px');r.setProperty('--sz',state.sz+'px');const arc=document.getElementById('arc');arc.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray',L.toFixed(2));arc.setAttribute('stroke-dashoffset',(L*(1-state.val/100)).toFixed(2));const ang=-90+state.val/100*180;document.getElementById('needle').setAttribute('transform','rotate('+ang.toFixed(2)+' 100 105)');document.getElementById('vt').textContent=state.val;}\\\\napply();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
