{"id":"M197","标题":"动态柱状图","适配端":"通用","元素":"数据","风格":"科技未来","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["柱状","动画","canvas"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/动态柱状图.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"柱色","类型":"color","默认":"#22d3ee"},{"键":"c2","名":"基线色","类型":"color","默认":"#0e7490"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"gap","名":"柱间距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":30,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"n","名":"柱数量","类型":"slider","最小":3,"最大":16,"步长":1,"默认":9},{"键":"speed","名":"速度","类型":"slider","最小":0.3,"最大":3,"步长":0.1,"默认":1},{"键":"max","名":"最大值","类型":"slider","最小":40,"最大":100,"步长":1,"默认":100}],"效果说明":"一组柱子从底部生长出来的入场动画，之后保持，改数值或数量会重新播放生长。适合趋势、销量、排名。","用法":"canvas 用 requestAnimationFrame 把高度从 0 缓动到目标（ease-out），改参数重置 t0 重播；DPR 缩放保证清晰。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML（深色背景，canvas）：一组柱子从底部生长入场，改数值/数量会重播动画。CSS 变量控制柱色、柱间距、数量、速度，DPR 缩放清晰。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>动态柱状图</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#22d3ee;--c2:#0e7490;--c3:#e5e7eb;--bg:#0f172a;--gap:14;--n:9;--speed:1;--max:100;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(94vw,460px);background:#111827;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\\\\ncanvas{width:100%;height:240px;display:block}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><canvas id=\\\\\\\"cv\\\\\\\"></canvas></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#22d3ee\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#0e7490\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",gap:14,n:9,speed:1,max:100};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');\\\\nfunction data(){const a=[];for(let i=0;i<state.n;i++){a.push(20+Math.abs(Math.sin(i*1.7)*state.max*0.8)+ (i%3)*6);}return a;}\\\\nlet t0=performance.now();\\\\nfunction resize(){const dpr=devicePixelRatio||1,w=cv.clientWidth,h=cv.clientHeight;cv.width=w*dpr;cv.height=h*dpr;ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);}\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--n',state.n);r.setProperty('--speed',state.speed);r.setProperty('--max',state.max);resize();t0=performance.now();}\\\\napply();\\\\nfunction draw(e){const w=cv.clientWidth,h=cv.height?cv.clientHeight:240,pad=18;ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const arr=data();const max=Math.max.apply(null,arr);const bw=(w-pad*2)/arr.length-state.gap;ctx.fillStyle=state.c2;ctx.fillRect(pad,h-22,w-pad*2,2);\\\\n arr.forEach((v,i)=>{const bh=(v/max)*(h-50)*e;const x=pad+i*(bw+state.gap);ctx.fillStyle=state.c1;ctx.fillRect(x,pad+(h-50-pad)-bh+0,bw,bh);});}\\\\nfunction loop(now){const p=Math.min(1,(now-t0)/(900/state.speed));const e=1-Math.pow(1-p,3);draw(e);requestAnimationFrame(loop);}\\\\nrequestAnimationFrame(loop);\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
