{"id":"M198","标题":"专注分段图","适配端":"通用","元素":"数据","风格":"暗色","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["分段","占比","时间"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/专注分段图.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"段1色","类型":"color","默认":"#6366f1"},{"键":"c2","名":"段2色","类型":"color","默认":"#22c55e"},{"键":"c3","名":"段3色","类型":"color","默认":"#f59e0b"},{"键":"c4","名":"段4色","类型":"color","默认":"#ef4444"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"gap","名":"段间距","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":16,"步长":1,"默认":6},{"键":"h","名":"条高","类型":"slider","最小":30,"最大":80,"步长":1,"默认":54},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":18}],"效果说明":"一条横条按占比切成几段不同颜色，每段标名称与百分比，像一天的时间分配。适合构成、占比、分布。","用法":"SEG 数组存每段的颜色键与占比，渲染时 width=占比% 并填对应 CSS 变量色；改 SEG 即改图。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML（深色背景）：一条横条按占比切成多段不同颜色，每段标名称与百分比。CSS 变量控制各段颜色、段间距、条高。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>专注分段图</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#6366f1;--c2:#22c55e;--c3:#f59e0b;--c4:#ef4444;--bg:#0f172a;--gap:6px;--h:54px;--pad:18px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:#e5e7eb;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(94vw,460px)}\\\\n.bar{display:flex;gap:var(--gap);height:var(--h);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06)}\\\\n.seg{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap}\\\\n.leg{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:14px;font-size:12px;opacity:.8}\\\\n.leg i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:middle}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"bar\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"bar\\\\\\\"></div><div class=\\\\\\\"leg\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"leg\\\\\\\"></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#6366f1\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#22c55e\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#f59e0b\\\\\\\",c4:\\\\\\\"#ef4444\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",gap:6,h:54,pad:18};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nconst SEG=[{k:'c1',t:'工作',v:42},{k:'c2',t:'学习',v:26},{k:'c3',t:'运动',v:18},{k:'c4',t:'休息',v:14}];\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--c4',state.c4);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--h',state.h+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');const bar=document.getElementById('bar');bar.innerHTML='';SEG.forEach(s=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='seg';d.style.background='var(--'+s.k+')';d.style.width=s.v+'%';d.textContent=s.t;bar.appendChild(d);});const leg=document.getElementById('leg');leg.innerHTML='';SEG.forEach(s=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.innerHTML='<i style=\\\\\\\"background:var(--'+s.k+')\\\\\\\"></i>'+s.t+' '+s.v+'%';leg.appendChild(d);});}\\\\napply();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
