{"id":"M199","标题":"范围折线图","适配端":"通用","元素":"数据","风格":"科技未来","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["折线","区间","趋势"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/范围折线图.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"均值线","类型":"color","默认":"#22d3ee"},{"键":"c2","名":"区间色","类型":"color","默认":"#22d3ee"},{"键":"c3","名":"坐标色","类型":"color","默认":"#64748b"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"gap","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":10},{"键":"n","名":"点数","类型":"slider","最小":6,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":12},{"键":"lw","名":"线宽","类型":"slider","最小":1,"最大":6,"步长":0.5,"默认":3}],"效果说明":"一条均值折线，外面包一层半透明区间带表示最大最小范围，一眼看波动与离散。适合区间估计、误差、温度带。","用法":"series() 生成 min/max/avg 三组值，band 用闭合多边形路径填充、avg 用 polyline；改 n 改变点数。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML（深色背景，SVG）：均值折线 + 外层半透明最大最小区间带。CSS 变量控制线色、区间色、线宽、点数。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>范围折线图</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#22d3ee;--c2:#22d3ee;--c3:#64748b;--bg:#0f172a;--gap:10;--n:12;--lw:3;--pad:18;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(94vw,480px);background:#111827;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\\\\nsvg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\\\\n.band{fill:var(--c2);opacity:.16}\\\\n.avg{fill:none;stroke:var(--c1);stroke-width:var(--lw);stroke-linejoin:round}\\\\n.axis{stroke:var(--c3);opacity:.3}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\\\\\"0 0 320 170\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"svg\\\\\\\"></svg></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#22d3ee\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#22d3ee\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#64748b\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",gap:10,n:12,lw:3,pad:18};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction series(){const mn=[],mx=[],av=[];for(let i=0;i<state.n;i++){const base=70+34*Math.sin(i/2)+14*Math.cos(i*0.8);mn.push(Math.max(4,base-14));mx.push(Math.min(100,base+14));av.push(base);}return{mn,mx,av};}\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--n',state.n);r.setProperty('--lw',state.lw+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');const W=320,H=170,p=state.pad;const s=series();const X=i=>p+i/(state.n-1)*(W-p*2);const Y=v=>H-p-v/100*(H-p*2);let band='M'+X(0)+' '+Y(s.mn[0]);for(let i=0;i<state.n;i++)band+=' L'+X(i)+' '+Y(s.mn[i]);for(let i=state.n-1;i>=0;i--)band+=' L'+X(i)+' '+Y(s.mx[i]);band+=' Z';let av='';for(let i=0;i<state.n;i++)av+=(i?' L':'M')+X(i)+' '+Y(s.av[i]);document.getElementById('svg').innerHTML='<line class=\\\\\\\"axis\\\\\\\" x1=\\\\\\\"'+p+'\\\\\\\" y1=\\\\\\\"'+(H-p)+'\\\\\\\" x2=\\\\\\\"'+(W-p)+'\\\\\\\" y2=\\\\\\\"'+(H-p)+'\\\\\\\"/><path class=\\\\\\\"band\\\\\\\" d=\\\\\\\"'+band+'\\\\\\\"/><path class=\\\\\\\"avg\\\\\\\" d=\\\\\\\"'+av+'\\\\\\\"/>';}\\\\napply();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
