{"id":"M202","标题":"环形占比图","适配端":"通用","元素":"数据","风格":"暗色","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["环形","占比","甜甜圈"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/环形占比图.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"段1色","类型":"color","默认":"#6366f1"},{"键":"c2","名":"段2色","类型":"color","默认":"#22c55e"},{"键":"c3","名":"段3色","类型":"color","默认":"#f59e0b"},{"键":"c4","名":"段4色","类型":"color","默认":"#ef4444"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"lw","名":"环宽","类型":"slider","最小":8,"最大":34,"步长":1,"默认":22},{"键":"sz","名":"尺寸","类型":"slider","最小":140,"最大":300,"步长":5,"默认":220}],"效果说明":"甜甜圈图，几段弧长拼成整圈表示各类占比，中心显示合计，外圈图例标各类。适合份额、构成。","用法":"每段 circle 用 dasharray=弧长+(周长-弧长)、dashoffset=-累计弧长 拼出扇段；rotate(-90) 让起点在顶部。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML（深色背景，SVG）：甜甜圈环形占比图，多段弧长拼整圈、中心显示合计、外圈图例。CSS 变量控制各段颜色、环宽、尺寸。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>环形占比图</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#6366f1;--c2:#22c55e;--c3:#f59e0b;--c4:#ef4444;--bg:#0f172a;--lw:22;--gap:0;--sz:220;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:#e5e7eb;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.wrap{width:min(86vw,var(--sz));position:relative}\\\\nsvg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;transform:rotate(-90deg)}\\\\n.seg{fill:none;stroke-width:var(--lw)}\\\\n.center{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transform:rotate(90deg)}\\\\n.center b{font-size:26px;font-weight:800}\\\\n.center span{font-size:12px;opacity:.6}\\\\n.leg{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;justify-content:center;font-size:12px}\\\\n.leg i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:middle}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"width:min(94vw,460px)\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"wrap\\\\\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\\\\\"0 0 120 120\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"svg\\\\\\\"></svg><div class=\\\\\\\"center\\\\\\\"><b id=\\\\\\\"tot\\\\\\\">100%</b><span>占比</span></div></div><div class=\\\\\\\"leg\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"leg\\\\\\\"></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst C=2*Math.PI*50;\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#6366f1\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#22c55e\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#f59e0b\\\\\\\",c4:\\\\\\\"#ef4444\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",lw:22,gap:0,sz:220};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nconst SEG=[{k:'c1',t:'A',v:40},{k:'c2',t:'B',v:28},{k:'c3',t:'C',v:20},{k:'c4',t:'D',v:12}];\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--c4',state.c4);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--lw',state.lw+'px');r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--sz',state.sz+'px');let off=0,html='';SEG.forEach(s=>{const len=C*s.v/100;html+='<circle class=\\\\\\\"seg\\\\\\\" cx=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" cy=\\\\\\\"60\\\\\\\" r=\\\\\\\"50\\\\\\\" stroke=\\\\\\\"var(--'+s.k+')\\\\\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\\\\\"'+len.toFixed(2)+' '+(C-len).toFixed(2)+'\\\\\\\" stroke-dashoffset=\\\\\\\"'+(-off).toFixed(2)+'\\\\\\\"/>';off+=len;});document.getElementById('svg').innerHTML=html;document.getElementById('tot').textContent='100%';const leg=document.getElementById('leg');leg.innerHTML='';SEG.forEach(s=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.innerHTML='<i style=\\\\\\\"background:var(--'+s.k+')\\\\\\\"></i>'+s.t+' '+s.v+'%';leg.appendChild(d);});}\\\\napply();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
