{"id":"M203","标题":"气泡图","适配端":"通用","元素":"数据","风格":"科技未来","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["气泡","散点","canvas"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/气泡图.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"气泡1色","类型":"color","默认":"#22d3ee"},{"键":"c2","名":"气泡2色","类型":"color","默认":"#a78bfa"},{"键":"c3","名":"气泡3色","类型":"color","默认":"#f472b6"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0f172a"},{"键":"gap","名":"间距","类型":"slider","最小":20,"最大":120,"步长":2,"默认":60},{"键":"n","名":"数量","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":24,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"speed","名":"速度","类型":"slider","最小":0.3,"最大":3,"步长":0.1,"默认":1}],"效果说明":"一群半透明气泡缓缓上浮，大小不一、颜色分组，适合表现规模、聚类与热度。调气泡数量、上浮速度与配色分组，即可在【数据感】与【氛围感】之间切换。","用法":"canvas 每帧把每个气泡 y 上移、出顶回底，颜色从 CSS 变量解析；改 n/speed 即时生效。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML（深色背景，canvas）：一群半透明气泡缓缓上浮、大小不一颜色分组。CSS 变量控制气泡配色、数量、速度，requestAnimationFrame 动画。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>气泡图</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#22d3ee;--c2:#a78bfa;--c3:#f472b6;--bg:#0f172a;--gap:60;--n:14;--speed:1;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:#e5e7eb;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(94vw,460px);background:#111827;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\\\\ncanvas{width:100%;height:280px;display:block}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><canvas id=\\\\\\\"cv\\\\\\\"></canvas></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#22d3ee\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#a78bfa\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#f472b6\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#0f172a\\\\\\\",gap:60,n:14,speed:1};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');\\\\nconst COL=['var(--c1)','var(--c2)','var(--c3)'];\\\\nfunction resolve(c){return getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue(c.replace('var(','').replace(')','')).trim()||'#22d3ee';}\\\\nlet bubbles=[];\\\\nfunction init(){bubbles=[];for(let i=0;i<state.n;i++){bubbles.push({x:Math.random(),y:Math.random(),r:14+Math.random()*26,vy:(Math.random()-.5)*.4,c:resolve(COL[i%3])});}}\\\\nfunction resize(){const dpr=devicePixelRatio||1,w=cv.clientWidth,h=cv.clientHeight;cv.width=w*dpr;cv.height=h*dpr;ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);}\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--n',state.n);r.setProperty('--speed',state.speed);resize();init();}\\\\napply();\\\\nfunction loop(){const w=cv.clientWidth,h=cv.height?cv.clientHeight:280;ctx.clearRect(0,0,w,h);bubbles.forEach(b=>{b.y-=b.vy*state.speed*0.004;if(b.y<-.1)b.y=1.1;const x=b.x*w,y=b.y*h;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x,y,b.r,0,7);ctx.fillStyle=b.c;ctx.globalAlpha=.55;ctx.fill();ctx.globalAlpha=1;});requestAnimationFrame(loop);}\\\\nrequestAnimationFrame(loop);\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
