{"id":"M204","标题":"拖拽排序","适配端":"通用","元素":"导航","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["拖拽","排序","列表"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/列表拖拽排序.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":12},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":24,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"gap","名":"行间距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":10}],"效果说明":"列表项可拖动重排，拖动时原位置变半透明，放下后顺序更新。适合优先级、清单、歌单。","用法":"HTML5 draggable + dragstart/dragover/drop，drop 时 splice 重排数组再渲染；不需要额外库。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：可拖拽重排的列表，拖动时原项半透明、放下后顺序更新。用 HTML5 draggable 与 drag/drop 事件，CSS 变量控制主色、圆角、间距。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>拖拽排序</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#e5e7eb;--rad:12px;--pad:14px;--gap:10px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--gap);width:min(92vw,340px)}\\\\n.it{background:var(--c2);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:var(--pad);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:grab;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);user-select:none}\\\\n.it.drag{opacity:.4}\\\\n.it .h{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--c1);opacity:.8;flex:0 0 auto}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"list\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"list\\\\\\\"></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",rad:12,pad:14,gap:10};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');}\\\\nlet items=['需求设计','前端开发','联调测试','灰度发布','复盘沉淀'];let dragIdx=-1;\\\\nfunction render(){const l=document.getElementById('list');l.innerHTML='';items.forEach((t,i)=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='it';d.draggable=true;d.innerHTML='<span class=\\\\\\\"h\\\\\\\"></span>'+t;d.addEventListener('dragstart',()=>{dragIdx=i;d.classList.add('drag');});d.addEventListener('dragend',()=>d.classList.remove('drag'));d.addEventListener('dragover',e=>e.preventDefault());d.addEventListener('drop',e=>{e.preventDefault();if(dragIdx>=0&&dragIdx!==i){const m=items.splice(dragIdx,1)[0];items.splice(i,0,m);dragIdx=-1;render();}});l.appendChild(d);});}\\\\napply();render();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
