{"id":"M205","标题":"批量勾选","适配端":"通用","元素":"反馈","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["勾选","批量","选择"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/批量勾选.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":12},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":24,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"gap","名":"行间距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":10}],"效果说明":"列表每项带复选框，顶部有全选，右上角实时显示已选数量。适合批量操作、多选。","用法":"每个 checkbox change 维护 Set，全选框切换全部；cnt 显示 size/总数。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：带复选框的列表 + 全选 + 实时已选计数。CSS 变量控制主色、边框、圆角，accent-color 统一勾选色。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>批量勾选</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#e5e7eb;--rad:12px;--pad:14px;--gap:10px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(92vw,340px);background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:var(--pad);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\\\\n.bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--bd);margin-bottom:12px}\\\\n.bar .all{font-weight:600}\\\\n.bar .cnt{margin-left:auto;color:var(--c1);font-weight:700}\\\\n.list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--gap)}\\\\n.it{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer}\\\\n.it input{width:20px;height:20px;accent-color:var(--c1)}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"bar\\\\\\\"><input type=\\\\\\\"checkbox\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"all\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"all\\\\\\\">全选</span><span class=\\\\\\\"cnt\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"cnt\\\\\\\">0/5</span></div><div class=\\\\\\\"list\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"list\\\\\\\"></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",rad:12,pad:14,gap:10};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');}\\\\nconst items=['设计稿评审','接口联调','埋点校对','回归测试','上线清单'];const sel=new Set();\\\\nfunction render(){const l=document.getElementById('list');l.innerHTML='';items.forEach((t,i)=>{const d=document.createElement('label');d.className='it';d.innerHTML='<input type=\\\\\\\"checkbox\\\\\\\" '+(sel.has(i)?'checked':'')+'>'+t;d.querySelector('input').addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target.checked)sel.add(i);else sel.delete(i);sync();});l.appendChild(d);});document.getElementById('cnt').textContent=sel.size+'/'+items.length;document.getElementById('all').checked=sel.size===items.length;}\\\\nfunction sync(){render();}\\\\ndocument.getElementById('all').addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target.checked)items.forEach((_,i)=>sel.add(i));else sel.clear();render();});\\\\napply();render();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
