{"id":"M206","标题":"配速滑杆","适配端":"通用","元素":"反馈","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["滑杆","惯性","物理"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/配速滑杆.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":24,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"sz","名":"手柄尺寸","类型":"slider","最小":20,"最大":40,"步长":1,"默认":30},{"键":"val","名":"当前值","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":100,"步长":1,"默认":50},{"键":"speed","名":"跟手速度","类型":"slider","最小":0.3,"最大":3,"步长":0.1,"默认":1}],"效果说明":"滑块手柄不会瞬间跳到光标处，而是带弹性地追上目标，松手吸附到整半格，有“跟手”的物理感。适合音量、亮度、强度。","用法":"target 跟光标、cur 每帧 cur+=(target-cur)*0.2*speed 缓动；松手 target 吸附到 0.5 的倍数。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：带弹性跟手的滑块，手柄缓动追上光标、松手吸附到半格。CSS 变量控制主色、手柄尺寸，requestAnimationFrame 做缓动。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>配速滑杆</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--rad:14px;--w:340px;--h:14px;--sz:30px;--val:50;--speed:1;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(92vw,var(--w));background:var(--c2);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:28px 20px 22px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);text-align:center}\\\\n.track{position:relative;height:var(--h);background:#d1d1d6;border-radius:999px;margin:34px 0 14px;touch-action:none}\\\\n.fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;height:100%;background:var(--c1);border-radius:999px;width:calc(var(--val) * 1%)}\\\\n.knob{position:absolute;top:50%;width:var(--sz);height:var(--sz);border-radius:50%;background:var(--c2);box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);left:calc(var(--val) * 1%);cursor:grab}\\\\n.read{font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:var(--c1);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\\\\n.sub{font-size:12px;opacity:.6}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"track\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"track\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"fill\\\\\\\"></div><div class=\\\\\\\"knob\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"knob\\\\\\\"></div></div><div class=\\\\\\\"read\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"read\\\\\\\">7.0</div><div class=\\\\\\\"sub\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"sub\\\\\\\">配速 分/公里</div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",rad:14,w:340,h:14,sz:30,val:50,speed:1};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nlet target=state.val,cur=state.val;\\\\nfunction show(){const pace=(10-state.val/100*6);document.getElementById('read').textContent=pace.toFixed(1);document.getElementById('sub').textContent='配速 '+(Math.floor(pace))+'分'+(Math.round((pace%1)*60))+'秒 / 公里';}\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--w',state.w+'px');r.setProperty('--h',state.h+'px');r.setProperty('--sz',state.sz+'px');r.setProperty('--val',state.val);r.setProperty('--speed',state.speed);show();}\\\\napply();\\\\nconst track=document.getElementById('track');let drag=false;\\\\nfunction setT(x){const b=track.getBoundingClientRect();let p=(x-b.left)/b.width*100;target=Math.max(0,Math.min(100,p));}\\\\ntrack.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{drag=true;track.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);setT(e.clientX);});\\\\ntrack.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(drag)setT(e.clientX);});\\\\ntrack.addEventListener('pointerup',()=>{drag=false;target=Math.round(target*2)/2;});\\\\n(function loop(){cur+=(target-cur)*0.2*state.speed;if(Math.abs(target-cur)<0.05)cur=target;state.val=cur;r.setProperty('--val',cur.toFixed(2));requestAnimationFrame(loop);})();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;if(d.key==='val')target=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
