{"id":"M208","标题":"步骤条","适配端":"通用","元素":"导航","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["步骤","进度","向导"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/步骤进度条.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"轨道色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆点圆角","类型":"slider","最小":999,"最大":999,"步长":1,"默认":999},{"键":"gap","名":"间距","类型":"slider","最小":2,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":8}],"效果说明":"横向步骤指示器，已完成打勾、当前高亮、底部进度条按比例填充，点步骤或“下一步”推进。适合下单、注册、向导。","用法":"cur 记录当前步，render 按 i<cur 标 done、i===cur 标 cur；line 宽度 = cur/(步数-1)。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：横向步骤条，已完成打勾、当前高亮、底部进度条填充，可点步骤或下一步推进。CSS 变量控制主色、轨道色、圆角。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>步骤条</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#e5e7eb;--rad:999px;--gap:8px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(94vw,420px);background:var(--c2);border-radius:16px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\\\\n.steps{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:var(--gap)}\\\\n.step{flex:1;text-align:center;cursor:pointer}\\\\n.step .dot{width:30px;height:30px;margin:0 auto 8px;border-radius:var(--rad);background:var(--bd);color:var(--c3);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;transition:.3s}\\\\n.step.done .dot,.step.cur .dot{background:var(--c1);color:var(--c2)}\\\\n.step .t{font-size:12px;opacity:.7}\\\\n.step.cur .t{opacity:1;font-weight:700}\\\\n.line{height:3px;background:var(--bd);border-radius:2px;margin:14px 0 18px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\\\\n.line i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;background:var(--c1);transition:width .3s;display:block}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"steps\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"steps\\\\\\\"></div><div class=\\\\\\\"line\\\\\\\"><i id=\\\\\\\"line\\\\\\\"></i></div><div style=\\\\\\\"text-align:center;color:var(--c1);font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;user-select:none\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"next\\\\\\\">下一步 ›</div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",rad:999,pd:8,gap:8};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nconst NAMES=['填写','确认','支付','完成'];let cur=0;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');}\\\\nfunction render(){const s=document.getElementById('steps');s.innerHTML='';NAMES.forEach((t,i)=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='step'+(i<cur?' done':'')+(i===cur?' cur':'');d.innerHTML='<div class=\\\\\\\"dot\\\\\\\">'+(i<cur?'✓':i+1)+'</div><div class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">'+t+'</div>';d.addEventListener('click',()=>{cur=i;render();});s.appendChild(d);});document.getElementById('line').style.width=(cur/(NAMES.length-1)*100)+'%';}\\\\napply();render();\\\\ndocument.getElementById('next').addEventListener('click',()=>{cur=Math.min(NAMES.length-1,cur+1);render();});\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
