{"id":"M209","标题":"开关联动","适配端":"通用","元素":"反馈","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["开关","联动","状态"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/开关联动.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":24,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"sz","名":"开关宽","类型":"slider","最小":40,"最大":70,"步长":1,"默认":54},{"键":"on","名":"是否开启","类型":"switch","默认":false}],"效果说明":"一个 iOS 风格开关，打开后下方面板平滑展开一组联动的附属选项。适合设置页、高级选项。","用法":"点开关切 state.on 并给容器加 .on 类，面板用 max-height 过渡展开；on 也是调参开关。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：iOS 风格开关，打开后下方面板平滑展开一组联动选项。CSS 变量控制主色、开关尺寸，.on 类驱动面板显隐。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>开关联动</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#e5e7eb;--rad:14px;--sz:54px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(92vw,340px);background:var(--c2);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\\\\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\\\n.row .t{font-weight:600}\\\\n.sw{width:52px;height:30px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--bd);position:relative;cursor:pointer;transition:background .25s;margin-left:auto;flex:0 0 auto}\\\\n.sw.on{background:var(--c1)}\\\\n.sw .kn{position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c2);transition:left .25s}\\\\n.sw.on .kn{left:25px}\\\\n.panel{opacity:0;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:.3s;margin-top:0}\\\\n.box.on .panel{opacity:1;max-height:200px;margin-top:16px}\\\\n.panel .f{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--bd);font-size:14px}\\\\n.panel .f .d{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--c1);opacity:.8}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"row\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">编辑模式</span><div class=\\\\\\\"sw\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"sw\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"kn\\\\\\\"></div></div></div><div class=\\\\\\\"panel\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"panel\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"f\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"d\\\\\\\"></span>拖拽排序已开启</div><div class=\\\\\\\"f\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"d\\\\\\\"></span>批量选择已开启</div><div class=\\\\\\\"f\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"d\\\\\\\"></span>快速删除已开启</div></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",rad:14,sz:54,on:false};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--sz',state.sz+'px');document.getElementById('box').classList.toggle('on',state.on);document.getElementById('sw').classList.toggle('on',state.on);}\\\\napply();\\\\ndocument.getElementById('sw').addEventListener('click',()=>{state.on=!state.on;apply();});\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
