{"id":"M210","标题":"卡片删除","适配端":"通用","元素":"反馈","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["删除","退场","卡片"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/卡片删除.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":12},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":24,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"gap","名":"行间距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":10}],"效果说明":"每张卡片有删除按钮，点击后卡片滑出并高度收起，下方卡片自动顶上。适合待办、通知、列表项移除。","用法":"点 × 加 .out 类触发过渡，transitionend 后从数组移除并重渲染。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：卡片列表，点删除按钮后卡片滑出并收起高度、其余顶上。CSS 变量控制主色、圆角、间距，transitionend 后移除。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>卡片删除</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#e5e7eb;--rad:12px;--pad:14px;--gap:10px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--gap);width:min(92vw,340px)}\\\\n.card{background:var(--c2);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:var(--pad);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.05);overflow:hidden;transition:opacity .28s,transform .28s,height .28s,padding .28s,margin .28s}\\\\n.card.out{opacity:0;transform:translateX(40px);height:0;padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;margin:0}\\\\n.card .d{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--c1);opacity:.85;flex:0 0 auto}\\\\n.card .x{margin-left:auto;width:28px;height:28px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);cursor:pointer;font-size:16px}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"list\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"list\\\\\\\"></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",rad:12,pad:14,gap:10};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');}\\\\nlet items=['待办：整理素材库','待办：写周报','待办：回复邮件','待办：健身打卡'];\\\\nfunction render(){const l=document.getElementById('list');l.innerHTML='';items.forEach((t,i)=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='card';d.innerHTML='<span class=\\\\\\\"d\\\\\\\"></span>'+t+'<button class=\\\\\\\"x\\\\\\\">×</button>';d.querySelector('.x').addEventListener('click',()=>{d.classList.add('out');d.addEventListener('transitionend',()=>{items.splice(i,1);render();},{once:true});});l.appendChild(d);});}\\\\napply();render();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
