{"id":"M212","标题":"标签让位","适配端":"通用","元素":"反馈","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["标签","退场","重排"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/标签让位.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2933"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":999,"最大":999,"步长":1,"默认":999},{"键":"gap","名":"间距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":10},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":10}],"效果说明":"一排标签，点某个的 × 它淡出缩没，剩下的标签平滑让位补齐空档。适合已选筛选、兴趣标签。","用法":"点 × 加 .out 触发过渡，transitionend 后从数组移除并重渲染，其余 flex 自动重排。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：一排圆角标签，点 × 淡出缩没、其余平滑让位补齐。CSS 变量控制主色、圆角、间距，flex 自动重排。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>标签让位</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2933;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#e5e7eb;--rad:999px;--gap:10px;--pad:10px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(92vw,360px);background:var(--c2);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\\\\n.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:var(--gap)}\\\\n.tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:var(--pad) calc(var(--pad) + 4px);background:rgba(0,122,255,.1);color:var(--c1);border-radius:var(--rad);font-size:14px;transition:opacity .25s,transform .25s,width .25s}\\\\n.tag.out{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7);width:0;padding:0;margin:0;overflow:hidden}\\\\n.tag .x{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c1);color:var(--c2);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"tags\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"tags\\\\\\\"></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2933\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",rad:999,gap:10,pad:10};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');}\\\\nlet tags=['设计','前端','后端','数据','运维','测试','产品'];\\\\nfunction render(){const t=document.getElementById('tags');t.innerHTML='';tags.forEach((x,i)=>{const d=document.createElement('span');d.className='tag';d.innerHTML=x+'<span class=\\\\\\\"x\\\\\\\">×</span>';d.querySelector('.x').addEventListener('click',e=>{e.stopPropagation();d.classList.add('out');d.addEventListener('transitionend',()=>{tags.splice(i,1);render();},{once:true});});t.appendChild(d);});}\\\\napply();render();\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
