{"id":"M213","标题":"主题切换","适配端":"通用","元素":"反馈","风格":"iOS 原生","场景":"工具·SaaS","标签":["主题","明暗","切换"],"来源":"来自于抖音","效果演示":"assets/demos/明暗模式切换.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","名":"主色","类型":"color","默认":"#007aff"},{"键":"c2","名":"底色","类型":"color","默认":"#ffffff"},{"键":"c3","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#f2f2f7"},{"键":"bd","名":"边框色","类型":"color","默认":"#e5e7eb"},{"键":"rad","名":"圆角","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":24,"步长":1,"默认":14},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":4,"最大":28,"步长":1,"默认":18},{"键":"on","名":"深色模式","类型":"switch","默认":false}],"效果说明":"一个开关切换预览卡片的浅色/深色主题，背景与文字平滑过渡。适合暗黑模式、主题预览。","用法":"点开关切 state.on，给预览卡加 .dark/.light 类；on 也是调参开关。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：开关切换预览卡片的浅色/深色主题，背景文字平滑过渡。CSS 变量控制主色、边框、圆角，.dark/.light 类切换主题。","代码":"\"\\\"<!doctype html><html lang=\\\\\\\"zh-CN\\\\\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\\\\\"utf-8\\\\\\\"><meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\\\\\"><title>主题切换</title>\\\\n<style>\\\\n:root{--c1:#007aff;--c2:#ffffff;--c3:#1f2937;--bg:#f2f2f7;--bd:#e5e7eb;--rad:14px;--pad:18px;}\\\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\\\nbody{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\\\\\\\"Segoe UI\\\\\\\",Roboto,\\\\\\\"PingFang SC\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\\\\\",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--c3);min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}\\\\n.box{width:min(92vw,340px);background:var(--c2);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:var(--rad);padding:var(--pad);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06)}\\\\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}\\\\n.row .t{font-weight:600}\\\\n.sw{width:52px;height:30px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--bd);position:relative;cursor:pointer;transition:background .25s;margin-left:auto}\\\\n.sw.on{background:var(--c1)}\\\\n.sw .kn{position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c2);transition:left .25s}\\\\n.sw.on .kn{left:25px}\\\\n.preview{border-radius:12px;padding:16px;transition:.3s}\\\\n.preview.light{background:#f8fafc;color:#1f2937}\\\\n.preview.dark{background:#1e293b;color:#e5e7eb}\\\\n.preview h4{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--c1)}\\\\n.preview p{margin:0;font-size:13px;opacity:.8;line-height:1.6}\\\\n</style></head><body>\\\\n<div class=\\\\\\\"box\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"row\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"t\\\\\\\">深色模式</span><div class=\\\\\\\"sw\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"sw\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"kn\\\\\\\"></div></div></div><div class=\\\\\\\"preview light\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"pv\\\\\\\"><h4>预览卡片</h4><p>切换上面的开关，这张卡片会在浅色和深色之间平滑过渡，文字与背景自动适配。</p></div></div>\\\\n<script>\\\\nconst state={c1:\\\\\\\"#007aff\\\\\\\",c2:\\\\\\\"#ffffff\\\\\\\",c3:\\\\\\\"#1f2937\\\\\\\",bg:\\\\\\\"#f2f2f7\\\\\\\",bd:\\\\\\\"#e5e7eb\\\\\\\",rad:14,pad:18,on:false};\\\\nconst r=document.documentElement.style;\\\\nfunction apply(){r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1);r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2);r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);r.setProperty('--bd',state.bd);r.setProperty('--rad',state.rad+'px');r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');document.getElementById('sw').classList.toggle('on',state.on);document.getElementById('pv').className='preview '+(state.on?'dark':'light');}\\\\napply();\\\\ndocument.getElementById('sw').addEventListener('click',()=>{state.on=!state.on;apply();});\\\\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(d.key in state){state[d.key]=d.value;apply();}});\\\\n<\\\\/script></body></html>\\\\n\\\"\""}
