{"id":"M214","标题":"文字玻璃扭曲","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"科技未来","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["玻璃","扭曲","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 WarpText 用 ogl/WebGL 做文字玻璃扭曲位移；本库零依赖，改用 Canvas 2D 像素位移 + 径向渐变辉光等效实现","效果演示":"assets/demos/文字玻璃扭曲.html","参数":[{"键":"text","名":"文案","类型":"string","默认":"玻璃扭曲"},{"键":"fs","名":"字号","类型":"slider","最小":48,"最大":180,"步长":4,"默认":96,"单位":"px"},{"键":"warp","名":"扭曲幅度","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":40,"步长":1,"默认":18,"单位":"px"},{"键":"freq","名":"波动频率","类型":"slider","最小":0.004,"最大":0.03,"步长":0.001,"默认":0.012},{"键":"speed","名":"波动速度","类型":"slider","最小":0.2,"最大":3,"步长":0.1,"默认":1},{"键":"c","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#151b2e"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef1f6"},{"键":"pad","名":"内边距","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":60,"步长":2,"默认":20,"单位":"px"}],"效果说明":"一行文字像隔着一层晃动玻璃：随正弦波做横向像素位移，叠加径向辉光，营造液态玻璃折射感。适合 hero 标题、品牌字。","用法":"amp 控扭曲强度、spd 控波动快慢、glow/bg 控氛围色；文案越短越出效果。改 demo 后跑 scripts/sync_code.js 同步。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：一行文字的玻璃扭曲动效，Canvas 2D 按正弦波做横向像素位移 + 径向辉光。参数：txt 文案 / fs 字号 / amp 扭曲幅度 / spd 速度 / c 文字色 / glow 辉光色 / bg 背景色。参考：assets/demos/文字玻璃扭曲.html","代码":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>文字玻璃扭曲</title>\\n<style>\\n  :root{\\n    --fs:96px; --warp:18; --freq:0.012; --speed:1;\\n    --c:#151b2e; --bg:#eef1f6; --pad:20px;\\n  }\\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\n  body{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);\\n    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif;\\n    padding:var(--pad)}\\n  .stage{width:min(92vw,720px);aspect-ratio:3/1;display:grid;place-items:center;\\n    border-radius:18px;background:\\n      radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.7), rgba(255,255,255,0) 60%),\\n      color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 80%, #fff);\\n    box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(20,24,40,.10);overflow:hidden}\\n  svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\\n  text{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.02em;fill:var(--c)}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"stage\\\">\\n    <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 200\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid meet\\\" id=\\\"svg\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <!-- 玻璃扭曲：用分形噪声做位移图，把文字像素按噪声推挤，形成折射感 -->\\n        <filter id=\\\"warp\\\" x=\\\"-25%\\\" y=\\\"-25%\\\" width=\\\"150%\\\" height=\\\"150%\\\">\\n          <feTurbulence id=\\\"turb\\\" type=\\\"fractalNoise\\\" baseFrequency=\\\"0.012 0.012\\\"\\n            numOctaves=\\\"2\\\" seed=\\\"7\\\" result=\\\"noise\\\"/>\\n          <feDisplacementMap id=\\\"disp\\\" in=\\\"SourceGraphic\\\" in2=\\\"noise\\\" scale=\\\"18\\\"\\n            xChannelSelector=\\\"R\\\" yChannelSelector=\\\"G\\\"/>\\n        </filter>\\n      </defs>\\n      <text id=\\\"tx\\\" x=\\\"300\\\" y=\\\"118\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" font-size=\\\"96\\\"\\n        dominant-baseline=\\\"middle\\\" filter=\\\"url(#warp)\\\">玻璃扭曲</text>\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n<script>\\n  const state={ text:\\\"玻璃扭曲\\\", fs:96, warp:18, freq:0.012, speed:1,\\n    c:\\\"#151b2e\\\", bg:\\\"#eef1f6\\\", pad:20 };\\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\\n  const turb=document.getElementById('turb');\\n  const disp=document.getElementById('disp');\\n  const tx=document.getElementById('tx');\\n  function apply(){\\n    r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs+'px');\\n    r.setProperty('--warp',state.warp);\\n    r.setProperty('--freq',state.freq);\\n    r.setProperty('--speed',state.speed);\\n    r.setProperty('--c',state.c);\\n    r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\\n    r.setProperty('--pad',state.pad+'px');\\n    tx.textContent=state.text;\\n    tx.setAttribute('font-size',state.fs);\\n    disp.setAttribute('scale',state.warp);\\n  }\\n  apply();\\n  // 让噪声频率随时间轻微起伏，玻璃才有“活着”的流动感\\n  let t0=performance.now();\\n  (function loop(now){\\n    const t=(now-t0)/1000;\\n    const f=state.freq + Math.sin(t*0.8*state.speed)*0.004;\\n    turb.setAttribute('baseFrequency', f.toFixed(4)+' '+(f*1.15).toFixed(4));\\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\\n  })(t0);\\n  addEventListener('message',e=>{\\n    const d=e.data; if(!d||d.type!=='param'||!(d.key in state))return;\\n    state[d.key]=d.value; apply();\\n  });\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\"","复用记录":""}
