{"id":"M215","标题":"翻牌文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["翻牌","机械","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 SplitFlapText 用 React/GSAP；本库零依赖，改用原生 DOM + CSS 3D 翻牌逐字滚动到目标字符","效果演示":"assets/demos/翻牌文字.html","参数":[{"键":"words","名":"轮播词条","类型":"string","默认":"HELLO,NEURAL,REACT,WORLD"},{"键":"fs","名":"字号","类型":"slider","最小":24,"最大":120,"步长":4,"默认":48,"单位":"px"},{"键":"flap","名":"翻牌色","类型":"color","默认":"#1f2937"},{"键":"text","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#f8fafc"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef1f6"},{"键":"cell","名":"格尺寸","类型":"slider","最小":24,"最大":80,"步长":2,"默认":44,"单位":"px"},{"键":"dur","名":"翻牌时长","类型":"slider","最小":120,"最大":900,"步长":20,"默认":420,"单位":"ms"},{"键":"gap","名":"字间距","类型":"slider","最小":2,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":6,"单位":"px"}],"效果说明":"像机场航班屏的机械翻牌：文字从旧字符逐格翻滚到目标字符，翻牌过程带 3D 折叶。适合切换标语、倒计时、数字。","用法":"dur 控单次翻牌时长、fg/bg/panel 控配色；改文案即时重播翻牌。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：机械翻牌文字，逐字从旧字符 3D 翻滚到目标字符。参数：txt 文案 / fs 字号 / fg 文字色 / bg 底色 / panel 面板色 / dur 时长 / gap 字间距。参考：assets/demos/翻牌文字.html","代码":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>翻牌文字</title>\\n<style>\\n  :root{\\n    --fs:48px; --flap:#1f2937; --text:#f8fafc; --bg:#eef1f6;\\n    --cell:44px; --dur:420ms; --gap:6px;\\n  }\\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\n  body{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);\\n    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif;\\n    padding:24px}\\n  .board{display:flex;gap:var(--gap);padding:18px;border-radius:16px;\\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 70%, #000 4%);\\n    box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(20,24,40,.14)}\\n  .cell{position:relative;width:var(--cell);height:calc(var(--cell)*1.32);\\n    perspective:calc(var(--cell)*3);font-size:var(--fs);font-weight:800}\\n  .cell .top,.cell .bot{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;height:50%;overflow:hidden;\\n    background:var(--flap);color:var(--text);display:flex;justify-content:center;\\n    border-radius:6px;backface-visibility:hidden}\\n  .cell .top{align-items:flex-end;padding-bottom:2px}\\n  .cell .bot{align-items:flex-start;padding-top:2px;top:50%}\\n  /* 翻动叶片：上半固定、下半随翻转，制造机械翻牌的上下咬合 */\\n  .cell .leaf{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:50%;overflow:hidden;\\n    background:var(--flap);color:var(--text);display:flex;justify-content:center;\\n    align-items:flex-end;padding-bottom:2px;border-radius:6px;\\n    transform-origin:bottom;transform:rotateX(0deg);backface-visibility:hidden;z-index:3}\\n  .cell .leaf span{transform:translateY(0)}\\n  .cell.flip .leaf{animation:flip var(--dur) linear forwards}\\n  @keyframes flip{from{transform:rotateX(0)}to{transform:rotateX(-180deg)}}\\n  .cell.dim .top,.cell.dim .bot{filter:brightness(.82)}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"board\\\" id=\\\"board\\\"></div>\\n<script>\\n  // 翻牌文字：轮播若干词条，字符像机场航班牌一样逐格翻动到目标字母\\n  const GLY=\\\"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ0123456789\\\";\\n  const state={ words:\\\"HELLO,NEURAL,REACT,WORLD\\\", fs:48, flap:\\\"#1f2937\\\",\\n    text:\\\"#f8fafc\\\", bg:\\\"#eef1f6\\\", cell:44, dur:420, gap:6 };\\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\\n  const board=document.getElementById('board');\\n  const wordList=()=>state.words.split(',').map(s=>s.trim().toUpperCase()).filter(Boolean);\\n  let cur=\\\"\\\", idx=0;\\n\\n  function build(n){\\n    board.innerHTML='';\\n    for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\\n      const c=document.createElement('div'); c.className='cell';\\n      c.innerHTML='<div class=\\\"top\\\"><span></span></div>'+\\n                  '<div class=\\\"bot\\\"><span></span></div>'+\\n                  '<div class=\\\"leaf\\\"><span></span></div>';\\n      board.appendChild(c);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  function show(str){\\n    const cells=board.children;\\n    for(let i=0;i<cells.length;i++){\\n      const ch=str[i]||'';\\n      cells[i].querySelector('.top span').textContent=ch;\\n      cells[i].querySelector('.bot span').textContent=ch;\\n      cells[i].classList.toggle('dim',!ch);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  // 把某格从 old 翻到 target：叶片带着旧字符下翻，上半先露出 target，下半在落定后补成 target\\n  function flipCell(cell,oldC,target){\\n    if(oldC===target){ cell.querySelector('.top span').textContent=target;\\n      cell.querySelector('.bot span').textContent=target; return; }\\n    const leaf=cell.querySelector('.leaf');\\n    const leafSpan=leaf.querySelector('span');\\n    const topSpan=cell.querySelector('.top span');\\n    const botSpan=cell.querySelector('.bot span');\\n    topSpan.textContent=target;   // 叶片翻过 90° 后露出的上半 = 目标\\n    botSpan.textContent=oldC;     // 翻转期间下半仍是旧字符\\n    leafSpan.textContent=oldC;\\n    cell.classList.remove('flip'); void cell.offsetWidth; cell.classList.add('flip');\\n    // 叶片正面滚过几个字符增加机械感，结束落在 target\\n    let step=0; const total=8;\\n    const iv=setInterval(()=>{\\n      step++;\\n      const ch=GLY[(GLY.indexOf(oldC)+step*3)%GLY.length];\\n      leafSpan.textContent=ch;\\n      if(step>=total){ clearInterval(iv); leafSpan.textContent=target; }\\n    }, state.dur/total);\\n    setTimeout(()=>{ botSpan.textContent=target; leafSpan.textContent=target; }, state.dur);\\n  }\\n  function advance(){\\n    const list=wordList();\\n    if(!list.length) return;\\n    const next=list[idx % list.length]; idx++;\\n    const w=Math.max(next.length, cur.length, 4);\\n    if(board.children.length!==w) build(w);\\n    const cells=board.children;\\n    const old=cur;\\n    for(let i=0;i<w;i++){\\n      const oc=old[i]||' '; const tc=next[i]||' ';\\n      // 上半/下半的落定交给 flipCell 处理，这里只错峰触发翻动\\n      setTimeout(()=>flipCell(cells[i],oc,tc), i*70);\\n    }\\n    cur=next;\\n  }\\n  function apply(){\\n    r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs+'px');\\n    r.setProperty('--flap',state.flap);\\n    r.setProperty('--text',state.text);\\n    r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\\n    r.setProperty('--cell',state.cell+'px');\\n    r.setProperty('--dur',state.dur+'ms');\\n    r.setProperty('--gap',state.gap+'px');\\n  }\\n  apply(); build(Math.max((wordList()[0]||'').length,4)); show(wordList()[0]||''); cur=wordList()[0]||'';\\n  setInterval(advance, 2200);\\n  addEventListener('message',e=>{\\n    const d=e.data; if(!d||d.type!=='param'||!(d.key in state))return;\\n    state[d.key]=d.value; apply();\\n  });\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\"","复用记录":""}
