{"id":"M216","标题":"回声文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"科技未来","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["回声","拖影","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 EchoText 用 React；本库零依赖，改原生逐层延迟复制文字做回声拖影","效果演示":"assets/demos/回声文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","名":"文案","类型":"string","默认":"ECHO"},{"键":"fs","名":"字号","类型":"slider","最小":40,"最大":160,"步长":4,"默认":80,"单位":"px"},{"键":"c","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#151b2e"},{"键":"echo","名":"回声色","类型":"color","默认":"#6366f1"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef1f6"},{"键":"count","名":"回声层数","类型":"slider","最小":1,"最大":8,"步长":1,"默认":4},{"键":"spread","名":"层间距","类型":"slider","最小":2,"最大":40,"步长":1,"默认":14,"单位":"px"},{"键":"dur","名":"呼吸时长","类型":"slider","最小":200,"最大":1200,"步长":50,"默认":600,"单位":"ms"}],"效果说明":"文字后方叠几层同文做延迟呼吸的彩色拖影，像声波回声，中心文字清晰、外圈渐隐。适合口号、强调词。","用法":"n 控层数、echo 控拖影色、gap 控层间距、spd 控呼吸快慢；文案短更聚焦。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：文字回声拖影，后方叠 n 层同文做延迟呼吸渐隐。参数：txt 文案 / fs 字号 / c 文字色 / echo 回声色 / n 层数 / gap 层间距 / spd 速度。参考：assets/demos/回声文字.html","代码":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>回声文字</title>\\n<style>\\n  :root{\\n    --fs:80px; --c:#151b2e; --echo:#6366f1; --bg:#eef1f6;\\n    --count:4; --spread:14px; --dur:600ms;\\n  }\\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\n  body{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);\\n    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif;\\n    padding:24px;overflow:hidden}\\n  .wrap{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;width:min(92vw,720px);height:min(60vh,360px)}\\n  .echo{position:absolute;font-weight:800;font-size:var(--fs);letter-spacing:.02em;\\n    color:var(--echo);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;will-change:transform,opacity;white-space:nowrap}\\n  .main{position:relative;font-weight:800;font-size:var(--fs);letter-spacing:.02em;\\n    color:var(--c);will-change:transform;white-space:nowrap}\\n  /* 回声：每道余像比上一道更透明、更远，沿移动反方向拖尾 */\\n  .echo.go{animation:echoOut var(--dur) ease-out forwards}\\n  @keyframes echoOut{\\n    from{opacity:.55; transform:translate(var(--dx),var(--dy)) scale(1)}\\n    to{opacity:0; transform:translate(calc(var(--dx)*3),calc(var(--dy)*3)) scale(1.04)}\\n  }\\n  .main.go{transition:transform .12s ease-out}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" id=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"main\\\" id=\\\"main\\\">ECHO</div>\\n  </div>\\n<script>\\n  const state={ text:\\\"ECHO\\\", fs:80, c:\\\"#151b2e\\\", echo:\\\"#6366f1\\\",\\n    bg:\\\"#eef1f6\\\", count:4, spread:14, dur:600 };\\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\\n  const wrap=document.getElementById('wrap');\\n  const main=document.getElementById('main');\\n  function apply(){\\n    r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs+'px');\\n    r.setProperty('--c',state.c);\\n    r.setProperty('--echo',state.echo);\\n    r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\\n    r.setProperty('--count',state.count);\\n    r.setProperty('--spread',state.spread+'px');\\n    r.setProperty('--dur',state.dur+'ms');\\n    main.textContent=state.text;\\n  }\\n  apply();\\n  let lastX=0,lastY=0,lastT=0,throttle=0;\\n  wrap.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{\\n    const now=performance.now();\\n    if(now-throttle<38) return; throttle=now;\\n    const rect=wrap.getBoundingClientRect();\\n    const x=e.clientX-rect.left, y=e.clientY-rect.top;\\n    const dx=x-lastX, dy=y-lastY; lastX=x; lastY=y; lastT=now;\\n    // 主文字朝光标轻微偏移；反向拖出 count 道渐隐回声\\n    main.style.transform='translate('+(dx*0.12)+'px,'+(dy*0.12)+'px)';\\n    for(let i=1;i<=state.count;i++){\\n      const ec=document.createElement('div');\\n      ec.className='echo go';\\n      ec.textContent=state.text;\\n      const ax=-dx*(state.spread/14)*i*0.5;\\n      const ay=-dy*(state.spread/14)*i*0.5;\\n      ec.style.setProperty('--dx',ax+'px');\\n      ec.style.setProperty('--dy',ay+'px');\\n      ec.style.opacity=(0.55/i).toFixed(3);\\n      wrap.appendChild(ec);\\n      setTimeout(()=>ec.remove(), state.dur+40);\\n    }\\n  });\\n  wrap.addEventListener('pointerleave',()=>{ main.style.transform='translate(0,0)'; });\\n  addEventListener('message',e=>{\\n    const d=e.data; if(!d||d.type!=='param'||!(d.key in state))return;\\n    state[d.key]=d.value; apply();\\n  });\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\"","复用记录":""}
