{"id":"M217","标题":"字符洗牌","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"科技未来","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["洗牌","解码","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Shuffle 用 React；本库零依赖，原生逐字从随机字符收敛到目标文案","效果演示":"assets/demos/字符洗牌.html","参数":[{"键":"text","名":"文案","类型":"string","默认":"SHUFFLE"},{"键":"c","名":"文字色","类型":"color","默认":"#151b2e"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#eef1f6"},{"键":"chars","名":"乱码字符集","类型":"string","默认":"!<>-_/[]{}—=+*^?#"},{"键":"speed","名":"速度","类型":"slider","最小":1,"最大":20,"步长":1,"默认":6},{"键":"dur","名":"时长","类型":"slider","最小":200,"最大":1500,"步长":50,"默认":700,"单位":"ms"},{"键":"auto","名":"自动循环","类型":"switch","默认":false}],"效果说明":"文字像在解码：每个字符从随机字符快速洗牌，逐位收敛到目标文案，最终定格成一句话。适合标题入场、密码/数据感。","用法":"spd 控洗牌快慢、dim 控乱码色、step 控每帧定格几字；文案长短影响时长。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：字符洗牌解码入场，逐位从随机字符收敛到目标文案。参数：txt 文案 / fs 字号 / c 文字色 / dim 乱码色 / spd 速度 / step 每帧定格数。参考：assets/demos/字符洗牌.html","代码":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>字符洗牌</title>\\n<style>\\n  :root{\\n    --fs:72px; --c:#151b2e; --bg:#eef1f6; --speed:6; --dur:700ms; --auto:0;\\n  }\\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\n  body{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);\\n    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif;\\n    padding:24px}\\n  .txt{font-weight:800;font-size:var(--fs);letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--c);\\n    cursor:pointer;user-select:none;white-space:nowrap}\\n  .txt .ch{display:inline-block;transition:opacity .1s}\\n  .hint{position:absolute;bottom:22px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;\\n    font-size:12px;opacity:.45;color:var(--c)}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"txt\\\" id=\\\"txt\\\">SHUFFLE</div>\\n  <div class=\\\"hint\\\" id=\\\"hint\\\">悬停洗牌 · 切换“自动循环”后持续滚动</div>\\n<script>\\n  const GLY=\\\"!<>-_/[]{}—=+*^?#________\\\";\\n  const state={ text:\\\"SHUFFLE\\\", c:\\\"#151b2e\\\", bg:\\\"#eef1f6\\\",\\n    chars:\\\"!<>-_/[]{}—=+*^?#\\\", speed:6, dur:700, auto:false };\\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\\n  const txt=document.getElementById('txt');\\n  const hint=document.getElementById('hint');\\n  let running=false, timer=null, loopTimer=null;\\n  function apply(){\\n    r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs+'px');\\n    r.setProperty('--c',state.c);\\n    r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\\n    r.setProperty('--speed',state.speed);\\n    r.setProperty('--dur',state.dur+'ms');\\n    r.setProperty('--auto',state.auto?1:0);\\n    txt.textContent=state.text;\\n  }\\n  // 悬停：每字符在 dur 内从随机字形逐步收敛到目标字符\\n  function shuffle(){\\n    if(running) return; running=true;\\n    const target=state.text.split('');\\n    const spans=target.map(ch=>{ const s=document.createElement('span');\\n      s.className='ch'; s.textContent=GLY[0]; txt.appendChild(s); return s; });\\n    const start=performance.now();\\n    const tick=()=>{\\n      const p=Math.min(1,(performance.now()-start)/state.dur);\\n      const reveal=Math.floor(p*target.length);\\n      spans.forEach((s,i)=>{\\n        if(i<reveal){ s.textContent=target[i]; s.style.opacity=1; }\\n        else { const g=state.chars[Math.floor(Math.random()*state.chars.length)];\\n               s.textContent=g; s.style.opacity=(0.4+Math.random()*0.6).toFixed(2); }\\n      });\\n      if(p<1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\\n      else { txt.textContent=state.text; running=false; }\\n    };\\n    txt.textContent=''; requestAnimationFrame(tick);\\n  }\\n  txt.addEventListener('pointerenter',()=>{ if(!state.auto) shuffle(); });\\n  // 自动循环：每隔一阵重新洗牌一次\\n  function autoLoop(){\\n    if(state.auto && !running) shuffle();\\n    loopTimer=setTimeout(autoLoop, state.dur+900);\\n  }\\n  apply();\\n  loopTimer=setTimeout(autoLoop, state.dur+900);\\n  addEventListener('message',e=>{\\n    const d=e.data; if(!d||d.type!=='param'||!(d.key in state))return;\\n    state[d.key]=d.value;\\n    if(d.key==='auto'){ hint.textContent=state.auto?'自动循环开启':'悬停洗牌 · 切换“自动循环”后持续滚动'; }\\n    apply();\\n  });\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\"","复用记录":""}
