{"id":"M218","标题":"光标辉光","适配端":"通用","元素":"背景氛围","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["光标","辉光","氛围"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 GlowCursor 用 React；本库零依赖，原生 radial-gradient 跟手辉光叠加暗底","效果演示":"assets/demos/光标辉光.html","参数":[{"键":"glow","名":"辉光色","类型":"color","默认":"#8b5cf6"},{"键":"glow2","名":"辉光辅色","类型":"color","默认":"#22d3ee"},{"键":"bg","名":"背景色","类型":"color","默认":"#0b0e1a"},{"键":"size","名":"辉光半径","类型":"slider","最小":80,"最大":500,"步长":10,"默认":240,"单位":"px"},{"键":"intensity","名":"浓度","类型":"slider","最小":0.1,"最大":1,"步长":0.05,"默认":0.65},{"键":"blur","名":"柔化","类型":"slider","最小":0,"最大":80,"步长":2,"默认":40,"单位":"px"},{"键":"follow","名":"跟随速度","类型":"slider","最小":0.05,"最大":1,"步长":0.05,"默认":0.55}],"效果说明":"暗底上跟着光标走的一团径向辉光，带缓动拖尾与柔化边缘，像手电照在雾面。适合氛围背景、互动 landing。","用法":"rad 控光团大小、blur 控边缘柔化、spd 控拖尾快慢、op 控浓度；移动端用 touch 位置驱动。","提示词":"零依赖单文件 HTML：暗底上跟手径向辉光，缓动拖尾 + 柔化边缘。参数：glow 辉光色 / bg 背景色 / rad 半径 / blur 柔化 / spd 速度 / op 浓度。参考：assets/demos/光标辉光.html","代码":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh-CN\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>光标辉光</title>\\n<style>\\n  :root{\\n    --glow:#8b5cf6; --glow2:#22d3ee; --bg:#0b0e1a;\\n    --size:240px; --intensity:.65; --blur:40px; --follow:.55;\\n  }\\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\n  html,body{height:100%}\\n  body{background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;\\n    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",\\\"PingFang SC\\\",\\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\",sans-serif;\\n    color:#cbd5e1;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:crosshair}\\n  /* 聚光灯：固定层，径向渐变跟随光标，模拟手电筒打在深色页面上 */\\n  .spot{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:var(--size);height:var(--size);\\n    border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\\n    background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--glow) 0%, var(--glow2) 38%, transparent 70%);\\n    opacity:var(--intensity);filter:blur(var(--blur));\\n    mix-blend-mode:screen;will-change:left,top}\\n  .content{position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:24px;max-width:560px}\\n  .content h1{font-size:clamp(28px,6vw,56px);font-weight:800;color:#f1f5f9;letter-spacing:.01em}\\n  .content p{margin-top:14px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;opacity:.7}\\n  .tip{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:20px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;opacity:.4;z-index:1}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"spot\\\" id=\\\"spot\\\"></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"content\\\">\\n    <h1>光标辉光</h1>\\n    <p>把光标当作手电筒，在深色画布上拖出一道柔光。适合官网首屏、作品集的氛围底。移动光标试试。</p>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"tip\\\">移动 / 触摸光标</div>\\n<script>\\n  const state={ text:\\\"光标辉光\\\", glow:\\\"#8b5cf6\\\", glow2:\\\"#22d3ee\\\", bg:\\\"#0b0e1a\\\",\\n    size:240, intensity:.65, blur:40, follow:.55 };\\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\\n  const spot=document.getElementById('spot');\\n  let tx=innerWidth/2, ty=innerHeight/2, cx=tx, cy=ty;\\n  function apply(){\\n    r.setProperty('--glow',state.glow);\\n    r.setProperty('--glow2',state.glow2);\\n    r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\\n    r.setProperty('--size',state.size+'px');\\n    r.setProperty('--intensity',state.intensity);\\n    r.setProperty('--blur',state.blur+'px');\\n    r.setProperty('--follow',state.follow);\\n  }\\n  apply();\\n  // 缓动跟随：光标目标实时更新，光斑每帧按 follow 比例逼近，避免生硬贴手\\n  (function loop(){\\n    cx+=(tx-cx)*state.follow; cy+=(ty-cy)*state.follow;\\n    spot.style.left=cx+'px'; spot.style.top=cy+'px';\\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\\n  })();\\n  addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{ tx=e.clientX; ty=e.clientY; },{passive:true});\\n  addEventListener('touchmove',e=>{ if(e.touches[0]){tx=e.touches[0].clientX;ty=e.touches[0].clientY;} },{passive:true});\\n  addEventListener('message',e=>{\\n    const d=e.data; if(!d||d.type!=='param'||!(d.key in state))return;\\n    state[d.key]=d.value; apply();\\n  });\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\"","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M219","标题":"描边文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"科技未来","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["文字","描边","动效","SVG"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Stroke Text 用 SVG 描边动画；本库零依赖原生 SVG 描边逐笔绘出+填充","效果演示":"assets/demos/描边文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"STROKE","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#7fd1ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"描边色"},{"键":"fill","默认":"#ffffff","类型":"颜色","说明":"填充色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"w","默认":2,"类型":"数字","说明":"描边粗细(px)"},{"键":"fs","默认":120,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":2.4,"类型":"数字","说明":"描边动画时长(s)"}],"效果说明":"SVG 文字先用描边逐笔画出，再淡入填充色，像手写落笔有先后节奏。适合首屏大标题入场；调描边色、线宽与时长可在\"硬朗工业\"与\"细腻手绘\"之间切换。","用法":"挂到首屏大标题或 section 标题；描边色与品牌强调色呼应。","提示词":"做一个描边文字标题入场动画：SVG 文字先以描边逐笔绘出，再淡入填充色。用法：挂首屏大标题或 section 标题，描边色取品牌强调色。关键参数：展示文字、描边色、填充色、背景色、线宽、字号、动画时长。集成步骤：1 把 demo 的 svg+text 结构贴进标题区；2 用 --c/--fill 对齐品牌色；3 用 --dur 控制落笔节奏，参数经 postMessage 实时调整。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>描边文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{ --c:#7fd1ff; --fill:#ffffff; --bg:#0a0e16; --w:2; --fs:120; --dur:2.4; }\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;\n  font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\nsvg{width:min(92vw,920px);height:auto;overflow:visible}\ntext{font-weight:800;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);letter-spacing:.04em;\n  fill:var(--fill);stroke:var(--c);stroke-width:calc(var(--w)*1px);paint-order:stroke;\n  stroke-dasharray:4000;stroke-dashoffset:4000;\n  animation:draw calc(var(--dur)*1s) ease forwards, fillin calc(var(--dur)*1s) ease forwards}\n@keyframes draw{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}\n@keyframes fillin{0%,55%{fill:transparent}to{fill:var(--fill)}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){text{animation:none;stroke-dashoffset:0;fill:var(--fill)}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 220\"><text id=\"t\" x=\"50%\" y=\"60%\" text-anchor=\"middle\">STROKE</text></svg>\n<script>\n// state 键 = 可调参数键；apply() 把它们映射到 CSS 变量与 DOM\nconst state={text:\"STROKE\",c:\"#7fd1ff\",fill:\"#ffffff\",bg:\"#0a0e16\",w:2,fs:120,dur:2.4};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  r.setProperty('--c',state.c); r.setProperty('--fill',state.fill); r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\n  r.setProperty('--w',state.w); r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs); r.setProperty('--dur',state.dur);\n  document.getElementById('t').textContent=state.text;\n}\napply();\n// 双轨预览契约：仅接受 type==='param' 且键存在于 state 的消息\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M220","标题":"景深文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["文字","景深","动效","焦点"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Depth Text 用 CSS 3D 透视；本库零依赖原生 3D 透视+模糊","效果演示":"assets/demos/景深文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"DEPTH","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#1a1a1a","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#efece3","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"depth","默认":34,"类型":"数字","说明":"每字推远(px)"},{"键":"blur","默认":5,"类型":"数字","说明":"远端模糊(px)"},{"键":"fs","默认":108,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"rot","默认":16,"类型":"数字","说明":"基础倾角(deg)"}],"效果说明":"同一行文字按字错峰设置不同模糊值，形成前后景深错觉，像镜头对焦在某一段字上。适合标题或标语；调模糊半径与错峰节奏能控制纵深强弱。","用法":"短标语/品牌词；浅底极简风配鼠标视差更出彩。","提示词":"做一个景深文字效果：一行文字按字符错峰赋予不同模糊，形成前后景深。用法：标题或标语，制造镜头对焦感。关键参数：文字、文字色、背景色、字号、模糊半径、错峰节奏。集成步骤：1 逐字拆 span；2 按索引分配 filter:blur 值；3 用关键帧让焦点缓慢游走。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>景深文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#1a1a1a;--bg:#efece3;--depth:34;--blur:5;--fs:108;--rot:16;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;\n  font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.scene{position:relative;perspective:900px}\n.word{display:flex;transform-style:preserve-3d;\n  transform:rotateX(calc(var(--rot)*1deg)) rotateY(-12deg);transition:transform .18s ease-out}\n.word span{display:inline-block;font-weight:800;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c);transform-style:preserve-3d}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"scene\"><div class=\"word\" id=\"w\"></div></div>\n<script>\n// 每个字按位置推远 + 模糊，形成 3D 景深；鼠标视差微调\nconst state={text:\"DEPTH\",c:\"#1a1a1a\",bg:\"#efece3\",depth:34,blur:5,fs:108,rot:16};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  r.setProperty('--c',state.c); r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\n  r.setProperty('--depth',state.depth); r.setProperty('--blur',state.blur);\n  r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs); r.setProperty('--rot',state.rot);\n  const w=document.getElementById('w'); w.innerHTML='';\n  const n=state.text.length;\n  for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\n    const s=document.createElement('span'); s.textContent=state.text[i];\n    const z=(i-(n-1)/2)*state.depth;\n    const b=Math.abs(i-(n-1)/2)*state.blur*0.12;\n    s.style.transform='translateZ('+z+'px)';\n    s.style.filter='blur('+b.toFixed(2)+'px)';\n    s.style.opacity=String(Math.max(.25,1-b*0.04));\n    w.appendChild(s);\n  }\n}\napply();\nconst sc=document.querySelector('.scene');\nsc.addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{\n  const b=sc.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const x=(e.clientX-b.left)/b.width-.5, y=(e.clientY-b.top)/b.height-.5;\n  sc.querySelector('.word').style.transform='rotateX('+(state.rot-y*10)+'deg) rotateY('+(-12+x*18)+'deg)';\n});\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M221","标题":"折叠文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["文字","折叠","动效","3D"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Fold Text 用 CSS 3D 翻折；本库零依赖原生逐字顶部翻折","效果演示":"assets/demos/折叠文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"FOLD","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#222","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#faf7f0","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"dur","默认":1.4,"类型":"数字","说明":"翻折时长(s)"},{"键":"fs","默认":104,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"persp","默认":800,"类型":"数字","说明":"透视距离(px)"},{"键":"fold","默认":1,"类型":"数字","说明":"起始折角倍数(0–1)"}],"效果说明":"文字像纸带一样沿中轴 3D 折叠翻转，正反两面交替出现，机械感强。适合标题切换或数字翻页；调翻转时长与折叠角度可控制机械感强弱。","用法":"关键词揭示、卖点标题；配短促缓动更利落。","提示词":"做一个折叠文字效果：文字沿横向中轴 3D 折叠翻转、正反面交替。用法：标题切换或数字翻牌。关键参数：文字、正反面文字色、背景色、字号、翻转时长、折叠角度。集成步骤：1 容器加 perspective 与 transform-style:preserve-3d；2 两个面 rotateX 互补；3 用 postMessage 调时长与色值。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>折叠文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#222;--bg:#faf7f0;--dur:1.4;--fs:104;--persp:800;--fold:1;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;\n  font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.word{display:flex;perspective:calc(var(--persp)*1px)}\n.word span{display:inline-block;font-weight:800;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c);\n  transform-origin:top center;transform:rotateX(calc(var(--fold) * -90deg));\n  animation:fold calc(var(--dur)*1s) cubic-bezier(.2,1,.3,1) forwards}\n@keyframes fold{to{transform:rotateX(0)}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.word span{transform:none;animation:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"word\" id=\"w\"></div>\n<script>\n// 逐字从顶部翻折落下（rotateX -90→0）；fold 控制起始折角倍数\nconst state={text:\"FOLD\",c:\"#222\",bg:\"#faf7f0\",dur:1.4,fs:104,persp:800,fold:1};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  r.setProperty('--c',state.c); r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\n  r.setProperty('--dur',state.dur); r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs);\n  r.setProperty('--persp',state.persp); r.setProperty('--fold',state.fold);\n  const w=document.getElementById('w'); w.innerHTML='';\n  const n=state.text.length;\n  for(let i=0;i<n;i++){const s=document.createElement('span');s.textContent=state.text[i];\n    s.style.animationDelay=(i*0.12)+'s'; w.appendChild(s);}\n}\napply();\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M222","标题":"环形文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"品牌海报","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["文字","环形","动效","排列"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Circular Text 用 SVG textPath；本库零依赖原生 textPath 环排+旋转","效果演示":"assets/demos/环形文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"CIRCULAR TEXT","类型":"字符串","说明":"环排文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#e9c46a","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#101418","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"r","默认":150,"类型":"数字","说明":"环半径"},{"键":"fs","默认":30,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"speed","默认":18,"类型":"数字","说明":"旋转一圈(s)"},{"键":"dir","默认":1,"类型":"数字","说明":"方向(1正/-1反)"}],"效果说明":"文字沿闭合圆环排布并整体缓慢自转，像印章或徽标边缘的环形标语。适合徽标/印章式标题；调半径与转速即可适配不同字号与节奏。","用法":"品牌环绕标语、loading 文案；半径与字号按视口调。","提示词":"做一个环形文字效果：文字沿完整圆环路径排布并整体自转。用法：徽标/印章式标题或装饰文字。关键参数：环形文字、文字色、背景色、半径、字号、旋转速度、方向。集成步骤：1 用 SVG textPath 挂圆形 path；2 JS 按半径重算 path 的 d；3 用 CSS animation 旋转容器，方向可翻转。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>环形文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#e9c46a;--bg:#101418;--fs:30;--speed:18;--dir:1;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;\n  font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.spin{width:min(86vw,440px);height:min(86vw,440px);animation:spin calc(var(--speed)*1s) linear infinite}\n@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}\ntext{fill:var(--c);font-weight:700;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.spin{animation:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<svg class=\"spin\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\"><defs><path id=\"circ\" d=\"\"></path></defs>\n<text><textPath id=\"tp\" href=\"#circ\" startOffset=\"0\"></textPath></text></svg>\n<script>\n// 文字沿圆形 path 排布并整体旋转；r 控制半径、dir 控制方向\nconst state={text:\"CIRCULAR TEXT\",c:\"#e9c46a\",bg:\"#101418\",r:150,fs:30,speed:18,dir:1};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  r.setProperty('--c',state.c); r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\n  r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs); r.setProperty('--speed',state.speed);\n  document.querySelector('.spin').style.animationDirection = state.dir<0 ? 'reverse':'normal';\n  const rad=state.r, cx=200, cy=200;\n  document.getElementById('circ').setAttribute('d',\n    'M'+cx+','+cy+' m'+(-rad)+',0 a'+rad+','+rad+' 0 1,1 '+(rad*2)+',0 a'+rad+','+rad+' 0 1,1 '+(-rad*2)+',0');\n  document.getElementById('tp').textContent = state.text.toUpperCase()+'  •  ';\n}\napply();\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M223","标题":"打字机文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"科技未来","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["文字","打字机","逐字","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Text Type 用 JS 打字；本库零依赖原生逐字打字+删除循环","效果演示":"assets/demos/打字机文字.html","参数":[{"键":"words","默认":"设计,构建,部署,进化","类型":"字符串","说明":"循环词(逗号分隔)"},{"键":"c","默认":"#d8f3dc","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0b1f17","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"caret","默认":"#52ffa8","类型":"颜色","说明":"光标色"},{"键":"speed","默认":90,"类型":"数字","说明":"每步毫秒"},{"键":"fs","默认":64,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"blink","默认":1.06,"类型":"数字","说明":"光标闪烁周期(s)"}],"效果说明":"文字像被逐个敲出、末尾光标闪烁，是最经典的开场手法。适合 hero 一句口号；调打字速度与光标色即可，触摸端同样可看，判通用。","用法":"Hero 副标题轮播动词；暗色终端风很搭。","提示词":"做一个打字机文字效果：文字逐字打出，末尾光标闪烁。用法：hero 区一句话口号或副标题。关键参数：文字内容、文字色、背景色、字号、每字间隔、光标色。集成步骤：1 用定时器递增已显示长度；2 用 slice(0,n) 取子串渲染；3 光标用 steps 关键帧闪烁，触摸端通用。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>打字机文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#d8f3dc;--bg:#0b1f17;--caret:#52ffa8;--fs:64;--blink:1.06;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;\n  font-family:ui-monospace,\"SF Mono\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace}\n.box{font-weight:700;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c);min-height:1.2em;text-align:center}\n.caret{display:inline-block;width:.5em;height:1.05em;background:var(--caret);\n  margin-left:.08em;vertical-align:-.12em;animation:blink calc(var(--blink)*1s) steps(1) infinite}\n@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.caret{animation:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"box\"><span id=\"t\"></span><span class=\"caret\"></span></div>\n<script>\n// 逐字打字 + 删除，循环多个词；speed 控制每步毫秒\nconst state={words:\"设计,构建,部署,进化\",c:\"#d8f3dc\",bg:\"#0b1f17\",caret:\"#52ffa8\",speed:90,fs:64,blink:1.06};\nlet wi=0, ci=0, del=false, timer=null;\nfunction list(){ return state.words.split(/[,，]/).map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean); }\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  r.setProperty('--c',state.c); r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\n  r.setProperty('--caret',state.caret); r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs); r.setProperty('--blink',state.blink);\n  if(timer)clearInterval(timer);\n  wi=0; ci=0; del=false; document.getElementById('t').textContent='';\n  timer=setInterval(tick, state.speed);\n}\nfunction tick(){\n  const L=list(), cur=L[wi]||'';\n  const el=document.getElementById('t');\n  if(!del){ ci++; el.textContent=cur.slice(0,ci);\n    if(ci>=cur.length){ del=true; clearInterval(timer); timer=setTimeout(()=>{timer=setInterval(tick,state.speed);},1100); }\n  } else { ci--; el.textContent=cur.slice(0,ci);\n    if(ci<=0){ del=false; wi=(wi+1)%L.length; clearInterval(timer); timer=setTimeout(()=>{timer=setInterval(tick,state.speed);},260); }\n  }\n}\napply();\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M224","标题":"故障文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["文字","故障","动效","赛博"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Glitch Text 用 RGB 错位+切片；本库零依赖原生双伪层错位","效果演示":"assets/demos/故障文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"GLITCH","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#f5f5f5","类型":"颜色","说明":"主色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0a0a","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景/遮罩"},{"键":"g1","默认":"#ff2e63","类型":"颜色","说明":"错位层1"},{"键":"g2","默认":"#08d9ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"错位层2"},{"键":"fs","默认":96,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"intensity","默认":6,"类型":"数字","说明":"错位位移(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":2.6,"类型":"数字","说明":"抖动周期(s)"}],"效果说明":"文字叠出红蓝重影并横向错位抖动，模拟信号故障与赛博失真。适合科技或游戏主题标题；调错位幅度与抖动频率控制\"故障感\"浓度。","用法":"赛博/故障风标题、活动主视觉；错位色用品牌二元色。","提示词":"做一个故障文字效果：文字带红蓝色差重影、横向错位并周期性抖动。用法：科技/游戏/赛博主题标题。关键参数：文字、文字色、红蓝重影色、背景色、字号、错位幅度、抖动频率。集成步骤：1 三层同字叠加、分别偏移与染色；2 用 mix-blend-mode:screen 叠色；3 关键帧制造随机错位脉冲。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>故障文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#f5f5f5;--bg:#0a0a0a;--g1:#ff2e63;--g2:#08d9ff;--fs:96;--intensity:6;--dur:2.6;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;\n  font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.glitch{position:relative;font-weight:800;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c);letter-spacing:.02em}\n.glitch::before,.glitch::after{content:attr(data-text);position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden}\n.glitch::before{color:var(--g1);transform:translate(calc(var(--intensity)*-1px),0);\n  clip-path:inset(0 0 55% 0);animation:gl1 calc(var(--dur)*1s) infinite linear alternate}\n.glitch::after{color:var(--g2);transform:translate(calc(var(--intensity)*1px),0);\n  clip-path:inset(55% 0 0 0);animation:gl2 calc(var(--dur)*1s) infinite linear alternate}\n@keyframes gl1{0%{clip-path:inset(0 0 60% 0)}20%{clip-path:inset(10% 0 50% 0)}40%{clip-path:inset(40% 0 30% 0)}60%{clip-path:inset(5% 0 70% 0)}80%{clip-path:inset(30% 0 40% 0)}100%{clip-path:inset(0 0 55% 0)}}\n@keyframes gl2{0%{clip-path:inset(60% 0 0 0)}25%{clip-path:inset(45% 0 10% 0)}50%{clip-path:inset(70% 0 5% 0)}75%{clip-path:inset(35% 0 35% 0)}100%{clip-path:inset(55% 0 0 0)}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.glitch::before,.glitch::after{animation:none;opacity:.5}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"glitch\" id=\"g\" data-text=\"GLITCH\">GLITCH</div>\n<script>\n// 双伪层 RGB 错位 + 切片 clip-path 抖动；intensity 控制位移、dur 控制节奏\nconst state={text:\"GLITCH\",c:\"#f5f5f5\",bg:\"#0a0a0a\",g1:\"#ff2e63\",g2:\"#08d9ff\",fs:96,intensity:6,dur:2.6};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  r.setProperty('--c',state.c); r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg); r.setProperty('--g1',state.g1);\n  r.setProperty('--g2',state.g2); r.setProperty('--fs',state.fs);\n  r.setProperty('--intensity',state.intensity); r.setProperty('--dur',state.dur);\n  const g=document.getElementById('g'); g.textContent=state.text; g.setAttribute('data-text',state.text);\n}\napply();\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M225","标题":"颗粒渐变背景","适配端":"通用","元素":"背景氛围","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["背景氛围","颗粒","渐变","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Grainient 用 WebGL/着色器颗粒；本库零依赖 CSS 渐变+SVG 噪声","效果演示":"assets/demos/颗粒渐变背景.html","参数":[{"键":"c1","默认":"#6a5cff","类型":"颜色","说明":"渐变1"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#ff5ca8","类型":"颜色","说明":"渐变2"},{"键":"c3","默认":"#ffd166","类型":"颜色","说明":"渐变3"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#101526","类型":"颜色","说明":"底色"},{"键":"grain","默认":0.16,"类型":"数字","说明":"颗粒强度(0–.5)"},{"键":"speed","默认":14,"类型":"数字","说明":"流动周期(s)"},{"键":"angle","默认":120,"类型":"数字","说明":"渐变角度(deg)"}],"效果说明":"大面积渐变上叠一层颗粒噪点，暗部细腻而不\"脏平\"，有胶片质感。适合暗色落地页背景；调颗粒强度与颗粒尺寸控制颗粒感轻重。","用法":"全屏背景、卡片底；颗粒强度别太高以免脏。","提示词":"做一个颗粒渐变背景：柔和渐变上叠一层颗粒噪点，暗色细腻质感。用法：暗色落地页/发布页背景层。关键参数：渐变起止色、背景色、颗粒强度、颗粒尺寸、动画速度。集成步骤：1 用 canvas 生成噪点；2 canvas 转 dataURL 当 background-image（务必包 url()）；3 与渐变用 mix-blend-mode 融合。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>颗粒渐变背景</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c1:#6a5cff;--c2:#ff5ca8;--c3:#ffd166;--bg:#101526;--grain:.16;--speed:14;--angle:120;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}\n.grad{position:fixed;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(calc(var(--angle)*1deg),var(--c1),var(--c2),var(--c3),var(--bg));\n  background-size:300% 300%;animation:flow calc(var(--speed)*1s) ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n@keyframes flow{0%{background-position:0% 50%}100%{background-position:100% 50%}}\n.grain{position:fixed;inset:0;opacity:var(--grain);mix-blend-mode:overlay;pointer-events:none}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.grad{animation:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"grad\"></div>\n<svg class=\"grain\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><filter id=\"n\"><feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\".9\" numOctaves=\"2\" stitchTiles=\"stitch\"/></filter><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" filter=\"url(#n)\"/></svg>\n<script>\n// 流动的青紫粉渐变 + feTurbulence 颗粒叠加；angle 控制方向、grain 控制颗粒强度\nconst state={c1:\"#6a5cff\",c2:\"#ff5ca8\",c3:\"#ffd166\",bg:\"#101526\",grain:.16,speed:14,angle:120};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  r.setProperty('--c1',state.c1); r.setProperty('--c2',state.c2); r.setProperty('--c3',state.c3);\n  r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg); r.setProperty('--grain',state.grain);\n  r.setProperty('--speed',state.speed); r.setProperty('--angle',state.angle);\n}\napply();\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M226","标题":"光线背景","适配端":"通用","元素":"背景氛围","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["背景氛围","光线","光束","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Light Rays 用 CSS 锥形渐变；本库零依赖原生 repeating-conic-gradient","效果演示":"assets/demos/光线背景.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#bfe9ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"光线色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#05070d","类型":"颜色","说明":"底色"},{"键":"rays","默认":14,"类型":"数字","说明":"光线数量"},{"键":"speed","默认":24,"类型":"数字","说明":"旋转周期(s)"},{"键":"spread","默认":0.34,"类型":"数字","说明":"单束宽度占比(0–1)"},{"键":"core","默认":"#9fdcff","类型":"颜色","说明":"中心辉光"}],"效果说明":"从中心放射出旋转的光线束，似舞台追光扫过，配中心光晕收束视线。适合暗色 hero 背景；调光线数、扩散比与转速即可改密度。","用法":"科技/能量感背景；光线数量与宽度调节疏密。","提示词":"做一个放射光线背景：中心放射状光线缓慢自转，叠中心光晕。用法：暗色 hero 背景氛围层。关键参数：光线色、背景色、光线数、转速、扩散比、核心光色。集成步骤：1 用 repeating-conic-gradient 造光线；2 用 animation 旋转；3 叠加 radial-gradient 中心光晕收束视线。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>光线背景</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#bfe9ff;--bg:#05070d;--rays:14;--speed:24;--spread:.34;--core:#9fdcff;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden}\n.rays{position:fixed;inset:-20%;background:repeating-conic-gradient(from 0deg at 50% 50%,\n  var(--c) 0deg, transparent calc(360deg / var(--rays) * var(--spread)), transparent calc(360deg / var(--rays)));\n  animation:spin calc(var(--speed)*1s) linear infinite;opacity:.5}\n.core{position:fixed;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, var(--core) 0%, transparent 26%);opacity:.55;mix-blend-mode:screen}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.rays{animation:none}}\n@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"rays\"></div><div class=\"core\"></div>\n<script>\n// 居中放射光线（repeating-conic-gradient），rays 控制数量、spread 控制宽度、core 中心辉光\nconst state={c:\"#bfe9ff\",bg:\"#05070d\",rays:14,speed:24,spread:.34,core:\"#9fdcff\"};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  r.setProperty('--c',state.c); r.setProperty('--bg',state.bg); r.setProperty('--rays',state.rays);\n  r.setProperty('--speed',state.speed); r.setProperty('--spread',state.spread); r.setProperty('--core',state.core);\n}\napply();\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M227","标题":"雷达背景","适配端":"通用","元素":"背景氛围","风格":"科技未来","场景":"后台·数据看板","标签":["背景氛围","雷达","扫描","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Radar 用 canvas 扫描；本库零依赖原生 canvas 扫描扇+光点","效果演示":"assets/demos/雷达背景.html","参数":[{"键":"bg","默认":"#02110a","类型":"颜色","说明":"底色"},{"键":"sweep","默认":"#27e08a","类型":"颜色","说明":"扫描色"},{"键":"grid","默认":"#0c6b3f","类型":"颜色","说明":"网格色"},{"键":"blip","默认":"#9dffd0","类型":"颜色","说明":"光点色"},{"键":"speed","默认":1,"类型":"数字","说明":"转速倍率"},{"键":"size","默认":1,"类型":"数字","说明":"半径倍率"}],"效果说明":"一条扫描线绕中心旋转，扫过的方位留下渐隐扇形残影，像雷达探测。适合监控/数据类暗色背景；调扫描速度与残影角度控制节奏。","用法":"监控/安全类后台底图、活动页氛围。","提示词":"做一个雷达扫描背景：扫描线绕中心旋转并留下扇形渐隐残影。用法：监控/数据类暗色背景。关键参数：扫描色、背景色、扫描速度、残影角度、同心环数。集成步骤：1 canvas 用角向渐变画扇形扇扫；2 旧帧以低透明度残留形成拖尾；3 叠加同心圆网格增强雷达感。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>雷达背景</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#02110a;--sweep:#27e08a;--grid:#0c6b3f;--blip:#9dffd0;--speed:1;--size:1;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}html,body{height:100%}\nbody{background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden}\ncanvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\n// canvas 雷达：同心网格 + 旋转扫描扇 + 随机光点淡出；size 控制半径、speed 控制转速\nconst state={bg:\"#02110a\",sweep:\"#27e08a\",grid:\"#0c6b3f\",blip:\"#9dffd0\",speed:1,size:1};\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');\nlet ang=0,blips=[];\nfunction resize(){cv.width=innerWidth;cv.height=innerHeight;}\naddEventListener('resize',resize);resize();\nfunction spawn(){ if(Math.random()<.04){blips.push({a:Math.random()*Math.PI*2,R:Math.random(),life:1});} }\nfunction apply(){\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--sweep',state.sweep);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--grid',state.grid);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--blip',state.blip);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--speed',state.speed);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--size',state.size);\n}\nfunction frame(){\n  const W=cv.width,H=cv.height,cx=W/2,cy=H/2,R=Math.min(W,H)*.42*state.size;\n  ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n  ctx.strokeStyle=state.grid;ctx.lineWidth=1;\n  for(let i=1;i<=4;i++){ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(cx,cy,R*i/4,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.stroke();}\n  ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(cx-R,cy);ctx.lineTo(cx+R,cy);ctx.moveTo(cx,cy-R);ctx.lineTo(cx,cy+R);ctx.stroke();\n  ctx.save();ctx.translate(cx,cy);ctx.rotate(ang);\n  ctx.globalAlpha=.18;ctx.fillStyle=state.sweep;\n  ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(0,0);ctx.arc(0,0,R,0,Math.PI/5);ctx.closePath();ctx.fill();\n  ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.strokeStyle=state.sweep;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(0,0);ctx.lineTo(R,0);ctx.stroke();\n  ctx.restore();\n  spawn();\n  for(const b of blips){b.life-=.012;\n    const x=cx+Math.cos(b.a)*R*b.R, y=cy+Math.sin(b.a)*R*b.R;\n    ctx.fillStyle=state.blip;ctx.globalAlpha=Math.max(0,b.life);\n    ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(x,y,3,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();}\n  ctx.globalAlpha=1;blips=blips.filter(b=>b.life>0);\n  ang+=.012*state.speed;\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n}\napply();frame();\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M228","标题":"像素拖尾光标","适配端":"PC 端","元素":"动效","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["动效","光标","像素","拖尾"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，2026-09-21 机制参考已重构，非复刻）：原站 Pixel Trail 用 canvas 拖尾；本库零依赖原生 canvas 像素拖尾","效果演示":"assets/demos/像素拖尾光标.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#36f9c0","类型":"颜色","说明":"拖尾色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#07090f","类型":"颜色","说明":"底色"},{"键":"size","默认":14,"类型":"数字","说明":"像素块(px)"},{"键":"life","默认":600,"类型":"数字","说明":"淡出时长(ms)"},{"键":"gap","默认":18,"类型":"数字","说明":"采样间距(px)"},{"键":"count","默认":140,"类型":"数字","说明":"拖尾上限"}],"效果说明":"光标移动时留下一串像素方块拖尾，像 8-bit 游戏的移动残影。适合像素风或游戏页；核心交互依赖光标，触摸端不可达，故判 PC 端。","用法":"全站光标彩蛋、互动页；间距与上限控制疏密与性能。","提示词":"做一个像素拖尾光标：光标移动时留下像素方块拖尾。用法：像素风/游戏主题页的鼠标装饰（触摸端不可达）。关键参数：拖尾色、背景色、方块大小、拖尾长度、消散速度。集成步骤：1 监听 mousemove 记录轨迹点；2 canvas 在轨迹上画方块并逐帧缩小；3 透明度随生存时间衰减。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>像素拖尾光标</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#36f9c0;--bg:#07090f;--size:14;--life:600;--gap:18;--count:140;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}html,body{height:100%}\nbody{background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;cursor:crosshair}\ncanvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\n// 鼠标移动留下渐隐像素方块拖尾；gap 控制采样间距、life 控制淡出时长、count 控制上限\nconst state={c:\"#36f9c0\",bg:\"#07090f\",size:14,life:600,gap:18,count:140};\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');\nfunction resize(){cv.width=innerWidth;cv.height=innerHeight;}\naddEventListener('resize',resize);resize();\nlet parts=[],last=null,lastUser=-1e9;\nfunction apply(){\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--c',state.c);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--bg',state.bg);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--size',state.size);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--life',state.life);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--gap',state.gap);\n  document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--count',state.count);\n}\nfunction push(x,y){\n  if(last){const dx=x-last.x,dy=y-last.y;if(Math.hypot(dx,dy)<state.gap){last={x,y};return;}}\n  last={x,y};\n  if(parts.length>=state.count)parts.shift();\n  parts.push({x,y,born:performance.now()});\n}\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{lastUser=performance.now();push(e.clientX,e.clientY);});\nfunction frame(){\n  const now=performance.now();\n  ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.fillRect(0,0,cv.width,cv.height);\n  if(now-lastUser>800){\n    // 自动演示：直接沿李萨如曲线铺一条渐隐拖尾，不靠累积——挂机/缩略图/headless 截图恒定可见\n    const N=52;\n    for(let k=0;k<N;k++){\n      const tt=now/1000-k*0.02;\n      const x=cv.width*(0.5+0.32*Math.sin(tt*0.9)),y=cv.height*(0.5+0.26*Math.sin(tt*1.4+1));\n      const a=1-k/N;ctx.globalAlpha=a;ctx.fillStyle=state.c;\n      const s=state.size*(0.4+a*0.6);ctx.fillRect(x-s/2,y-s/2,s,s);\n    }\n  }else{\n    for(const p of parts){const a=Math.max(0,1-(now-p.born)/state.life);\n      ctx.globalAlpha=a;ctx.fillStyle=state.c;\n      const s=state.size*(0.4+a*0.6);\n      ctx.fillRect(p.x-s/2,p.y-s/2,s,s);}\n  }\n  ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n}\napply();frame();\nwindow.addEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M229","标题":"渐变流光文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"科技未来","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["渐变","流光","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Shiny/Gradient Text 用渐变文字+流动；本库零依赖原生 background-clip:text + 渐变位移","效果演示":"assets/demos/渐变流光文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"GRADIENT","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c1","默认":"#6ee7ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"渐变色1"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#a78bfa","类型":"颜色","说明":"渐变色2"},{"键":"c3","默认":"#f472b6","类型":"颜色","说明":"渐变色3"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"fs","默认":96,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"sp","默认":6,"类型":"数字","说明":"流动速度(s)"},{"键":"ang","默认":90,"类型":"数字","说明":"渐变角度(度)"}],"效果说明":"三色渐变填充标题并让渐变带横向流动，像流光扫过字面。适合科技感标题；调三色与流速即可在冷/暖气质间切换。","用法":"挂首屏大标题或 section 标题；三色取品牌色系。","提示词":"做一个渐变流光文字：三色渐变填充标题、渐变横向流动。用法：科技感首屏大标题。关键参数：展示文字、渐变色 1/2/3、背景色、字号、流动速度、渐变角度。集成步骤：1 用 linear-gradient + background-clip:text；2 background-size 放大到 300%；3 动画 background-position 制造流动。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>渐变流光文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c1:#6ee7ff;--c2:#a78bfa;--c3:#f472b6;--bg:#0a0e16;--fs:96;--sp:6;--ang:90}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.txt{font-weight:900;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.1;\n  background:linear-gradient(calc(var(--ang)*1deg),var(--c1),var(--c2),var(--c3),var(--c1));\n  background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;\n  animation:flow calc(var(--sp)*1s) linear infinite;text-align:center}\n@keyframes flow{to{background-position:300% 0}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"txt\" id=\"t\">GRADIENT</div>\n<script>\nconst state={\"text\":\"GRADIENT\",\"c1\":\"#6ee7ff\",\"c2\":\"#a78bfa\",\"c3\":\"#f472b6\",\"bg\":\"#0a0e16\",\"fs\":96,\"sp\":6,\"ang\":90};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\ndocument.getElementById('t').textContent=state.text;\n}\n\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M230","标题":"模糊聚焦文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["模糊","聚焦","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Blur Text 用滤镜模糊再聚焦；本库零依赖原生 filter:blur + 关键帧","效果演示":"assets/demos/模糊聚焦文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"FOCUS","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#e8f0ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"fs","默认":110,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"blur","默认":14,"类型":"数字","说明":"模糊半径(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":3,"类型":"数字","说明":"周期(s)"},{"键":"hold","默认":0.6,"类型":"数字","说明":"清晰停留占比(s)"}],"效果说明":"文字周期性从模糊变清晰再模糊，像镜头来回对焦呼吸。适合需要\"浮现/定神\"语义的口号；调模糊半径与周期控制呼吸感。","用法":"用于需要\"浮现/聚焦\"语义的标题或口号。","提示词":"做一个模糊聚焦文字：文字周期性由模糊变清晰再回到模糊。用法：口号或标题的\"定神\"入场。关键参数：文字、文字色、背景色、字号、模糊半径、周期、清晰停留时长。集成步骤：1 用 filter:blur 配关键帧；2 中间留两帧 blur(0) 形成清晰平台；3 用 --dur/--hold 分别控周期与停留。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>模糊聚焦文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#e8f0ff;--bg:#0a0e16;--fs:110;--blur:14;--dur:3;--hold:0.6}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.txt{font-weight:800;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c);\n  filter:blur(calc(var(--blur)*1px));animation:focus calc(var(--dur)*1s) ease-in-out infinite calc(var(--hold)*1s)}\n@keyframes focus{0%,100%{filter:blur(calc(var(--blur)*1px))}45%,65%{filter:blur(0)}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"txt\" id=\"t\">FOCUS</div>\n<script>\nconst state={\"text\":\"FOCUS\",\"c\":\"#e8f0ff\",\"bg\":\"#0a0e16\",\"fs\":110,\"blur\":14,\"dur\":3,\"hold\":0.6};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\ndocument.getElementById('t').textContent=state.text;\n}\n\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M231","标题":"旋转词循环","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["旋转","轮播","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Rotating Text 用纵向翻转换词；本库零依赖原生 JS 定时切换词","效果演示":"assets/demos/旋转词循环.html","参数":[{"键":"words","默认":"设计师,开发者,创造者,思考者","类型":"字符串","说明":"词列表(逗号分隔)"},{"键":"c","默认":"#ffffff","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bar","默认":"#6ee7ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"下划线色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"fs","默认":96,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"sp","默认":2.2,"类型":"数字","说明":"每词停留(s)"}],"效果说明":"固定位置上的词定时纵向切换，配一条强调色下划线，强调多重身份。适合\"我是____\"句式；调每词停留时间与词表即可。","用法":"放在\"我是____\"这类句式，循环展示身份或卖点。","提示词":"做一个旋转词循环：固定位置的词定时纵向切换，配强调色下划线。用法：\"我是____\"句式展示多重身份或卖点。关键参数：词表、文字色、下划线色、背景色、字号、每词停留。集成步骤：1 定时器切换词 + 上下位移淡入淡出；2 词表以逗号分隔；3 下划线用强调色。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>旋转词循环</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#ffffff;--bar:#6ee7ff;--bg:#0a0e16;--fs:96;--sp:2.2}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.box{display:grid;place-items:center;gap:.4em;text-align:center}\n.word{font-weight:900;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c);transition:opacity .45s,transform .45s}\n.bar{width:3.2em;height:.16em;background:var(--bar);border-radius:2px;margin:0 auto}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"box\"><span class=\"word\" id=\"w\">设计师</span><i class=\"bar\"></i></div>\n<script>\nconst state={\"words\":\"设计师,开发者,创造者,思考者\",\"c\":\"#ffffff\",\"bar\":\"#6ee7ff\",\"bg\":\"#0a0e16\",\"fs\":96,\"sp\":2.2};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\ndocument.getElementById('w').textContent=(state.words.split(',').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean)[0]||'');\n}\nconst el=document.getElementById('w');let i=0;\nfunction tick(){const a=state.words.split(',').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean);if(a.length){i=(i+1)%a.length;el.style.opacity=0;el.style.transform='translateY(-.4em)';setTimeout(()=>{el.textContent=a[i];el.style.opacity=1;el.style.transform='translateY(0)';},260);}setTimeout(tick,(state.sp||2)*1000);}\ntick();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M232","标题":"滚动速度文字","适配端":"PC 端","元素":"文字","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["滚动","速度","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Scroll Velocity 让字母随滚动速度斜切；本库零依赖原生 wheel 事件+raf","效果演示":"assets/demos/滚动速度文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"SCROLL","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#9fe7ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"fs","默认":120,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"maxSkew","默认":26,"类型":"数字","说明":"最大斜切(度)"},{"键":"sens","默认":0.05,"类型":"数字","说明":"灵敏度"}],"效果说明":"滚轮滚得越快、文字整体越斜越抖，停手即回正，给滚动一点物理反馈。监听 wheel，触摸端不触发，故判 PC 端；调最大斜切角与灵敏度控制力度。","用法":"用于\"往下看\"的引导区，给滚动一点物理反馈。","提示词":"做一个滚动速度文字：文字随滚轮速度斜切抖动、停手还原。用法：页面引导区给滚动物理反馈（监听 wheel，触摸端不触发，判 PC 端）。关键参数：文字、文字色、背景色、字号、最大斜切角、灵敏度。集成步骤：1 监听 wheel 累积速度；2 每帧按速度设 skewX 并做衰减；3 速度映射到斜切与位移。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>滚动速度文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#9fe7ff;--bg:#0a0e16;--fs:120;--maxSkew:26;--sens:0.05}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:0 .02em;font-weight:900;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c)}\n.row span{display:inline-block;transform-origin:center;will-change:transform}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"row\"></div>\n<script>\nconst state={\"text\":\"SCROLL\",\"c\":\"#9fe7ff\",\"bg\":\"#0a0e16\",\"fs\":120,\"maxSkew\":26,\"sens\":0.05};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\nconst row=document.getElementById('row');row.innerHTML=[...state.text].map(ch=>'<span>'+(ch===' '?'&nbsp;':ch)+'</span>').join('');\n}\nfunction loop(){wheel*=0.9;const s=document.querySelectorAll('#row span');const v=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,wheel/40));s.forEach((sp,idx)=>{const f=Math.abs(v);sp.style.transform='skewX('+(v*state.maxSkew)+'deg) translateY('+(f*(idx%2?6:-6))+'px)';});requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M233","标题":"近大远小文字","适配端":"PC 端","元素":"文字","风格":"科技未来","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":[" proximity","鼠标","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Variable Proximity 让字母随鼠标距离缩放；本库零依赖原生鼠标距离计算","效果演示":"assets/demos/近大远小文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"PROXIMITY","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#cdeaff","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"fs","默认":84,"类型":"数字","说明":"基础字号(px)"},{"键":"maxScale","默认":1.8,"类型":"数字","说明":"最大放大倍数"},{"键":"radius","默认":220,"类型":"数字","说明":"影响半径(px)"}],"效果说明":"鼠标越靠近的字母越大、越远离越小，像被引力牵引。核心交互依赖光标，触摸端不可达，故判 PC 端；调放大倍数与影响半径控制引力强弱。","用法":"给标题加一点\"可玩\"的鼠标互动，提升停留。","提示词":"做一个近大远小文字：每个字母随鼠标距离缩放。用法：标题的鼠标互动装饰（依赖光标，判 PC 端）。关键参数：文字、文字色、背景色、基础字号、最大放大倍数、影响半径。集成步骤：1 逐字拆 span；2 每帧用 getBoundingClientRect 与 Math.hypot 算到鼠标距离；3 按距离线性映射 scale。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>近大远小文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#cdeaff;--bg:#0a0e16;--fs:84;--maxScale:1.8;--radius:220}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:0 .01em;font-weight:900;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c)}\n.row span{display:inline-block;transform-origin:center;will-change:transform}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"row\"></div>\n<script>\nconst state={\"text\":\"PROXIMITY\",\"c\":\"#cdeaff\",\"bg\":\"#0a0e16\",\"fs\":84,\"maxScale\":1.8,\"radius\":220};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\nconst row=document.getElementById('row');row.innerHTML=[...state.text].map(ch=>'<span>'+(ch===' '?'&nbsp;':ch)+'</span>').join('');\n}\nfunction loop(){const s=document.querySelectorAll('#row span');s.forEach(sp=>{const r=sp.getBoundingClientRect();const cx=r.left+r.width/2,cy=r.top+r.height/2;const d=Math.hypot(cx-mx,cy-my);const t=Math.max(0,(state.radius-d)/state.radius);const sc=1+t*(state.maxScale-1);sp.style.transform='scale('+sc.toFixed(3)+')';});requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M236","标题":"弧形文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"科技未来","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["弧形","路径","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Curved Loop 让文字沿路径排布；本库零依赖原生 SVG textPath，走的是**开放弧线 + 沿线流动**，与库内 M222「环形文字」（闭合圆环 + 整体自转）机制不同","效果演示":"assets/demos/弧形文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"CURVED","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#7fd1ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"渐变色起"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#f472b6","类型":"颜色","说明":"渐变色止"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"r","默认":170,"类型":"数字","说明":"弧线拱起高度(px)"},{"键":"fs","默认":32,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":12,"类型":"数字","说明":"流动一圈(s)"},{"键":"rep","默认":4,"类型":"数字","说明":"文字重复次数"}],"效果说明":"文字沿一条开放弧线排布并顺着弧线缓慢流动，像沿山脊铺开的标语。适合装饰性标题；调拱起高度与文字重复次数即可适配字幅。","用法":"做徽标/印章式标题或装饰文字。","提示词":"做一个弧形流动文字：文字沿开放弧线排布并沿线漂移。用法：装饰性标题或页脚标语。关键参数：文字、渐变起止色、背景色、弧线拱起高度、字号、流动周期、重复次数。集成步骤：1 SVG textPath 挂一条二次贝塞尔弧线；2 复制多份文字铺满弧线；3 JS 在受限范围内漂移 startOffset，保证始终可见。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>弧形文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#7fd1ff;--c2:#f472b6;--bg:#0a0e16;--r:170;--fs:32;--dur:12;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\nsvg{width:min(92vw,880px);height:auto;overflow:visible}\ntext{font-weight:800;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);letter-spacing:.08em;fill:url(#g)}\n#s1{stop-color:var(--c)}\n#s2{stop-color:var(--c2)}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 880 440\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"g\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\"><stop id=\"s1\" offset=\"0\"/><stop id=\"s2\" offset=\"1\"/></linearGradient>\n    <path id=\"arc\" d=\"\"/>\n  </defs>\n  <text><textPath id=\"tp\" href=\"#arc\" startOffset=\"0%\"></textPath></text>\n</svg>\n<script>\n// 文字沿一条开放的弧线排布，并顺着弧线持续流动；与「闭合圆环自转」是不同的机制\nconst state={text:\"CURVED\",c:\"#7fd1ff\",c2:\"#f472b6\",bg:\"#0a0e16\",r:170,fs:32,dur:12,rep:4};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n  // 直接写 stop-color（不依赖 CSS 变量，避免描边解析失败导致文字不可见）\n  document.getElementById('s1').setAttribute('stop-color',state.c);\n  document.getElementById('s2').setAttribute('stop-color',state.c2);\n  const tp=document.getElementById('tp');\n  tp.textContent=Array(Math.max(1,state.rep|0)).fill(state.text).join('   ·   ');\n  const cx=440, base=340, bulge=state.r*2;\n  document.getElementById('arc').setAttribute('d','M'+(cx-380)+','+base+' Q'+cx+','+(base-bulge)+' '+(cx+380)+','+base);\n}\napply();\n// 漂移量限制在一个重复长度内，保证任何时刻路径上都铺着文字（不会像全幅漂移那样整段移出）\nconst t0=performance.now();\nfunction loop(){\n  const off=((performance.now()-t0)/((state.dur||12)*1000))%1;\n  document.getElementById('tp').setAttribute('startOffset',(-off*(100/Math.max(1,state.rep))).toFixed(2)+'%');\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n}\nloop();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M237","标题":"波浪摆动文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["抖散","湍流","文字"],"来源":"③ 自研（正弦波逐字错峰摆动；2026-09-22 由原 react-bits 湍流类机制改造而来，机制已重写为自研摆动，非 feTurbulence/非 SVG 滤镜，与库内 M214「文字玻璃扭曲」、M224「故障文字」机制不同）","效果演示":"assets/demos/波浪摆动文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"WAVE","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#eaf6ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"fs","默认":84,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"amp","默认":22,"类型":"数字","说明":"摆幅(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":1.4,"类型":"数字","说明":"摆动周期(s)"},{"键":"ph","默认":0.09,"类型":"数字","说明":"逐字相位差(s)"},{"键":"sh","默认":"#1b3a5c","类型":"颜色","说明":"投影色"}],"效果说明":"每个字按正弦上下摆动，靠逐字错开的相位让一道波沿文字行进，像绳子被抖了一下。适合标题或引导语；调摆幅、周期与相位差可控制波的行进速度与幅度。","用法":"做\"故障/失真\"风格标题或艺术字。","提示词":"做一个波浪摆动文字：每个字上下正弦摆动，逐字相位错开形成行进的波。用法：标题或引导语的动态装饰。关键参数：展示文字、文字色、背景色、字号、摆幅、摆动周期、逐字相位差、投影色。集成步骤：1 逐字拆 span 并注入 --i 索引；2 关键帧 translateY 上下往复；3 用负 animation-delay 按索引错峰，形成行进波。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>波浪摆动文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#eaf6ff;--bg:#0a0e16;--fs:84;--amp:22;--dur:1.4;--ph:.09;--sh:#1b3a5c;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:0 .01em;font-weight:900;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c);text-shadow:0 calc(var(--fs)*.06px) 0 var(--sh)}\n.row span{display:inline-block;transform-origin:center;\n  animation:wave calc(var(--dur)*1s) ease-in-out infinite;\n  animation-delay:calc(var(--i) * var(--ph) * -1s)}\n@keyframes wave{0%,100%{transform:translateY(calc(var(--amp)*-1px))}50%{transform:translateY(calc(var(--amp)*1px))}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"row\"></div>\n<script>\n// 每个字按正弦上下摆动，靠负 animation-delay 让相位逐字错开，形成沿文字行进的波\nconst state={text:\"WAVE\",c:\"#eaf6ff\",bg:\"#0a0e16\",fs:84,amp:22,dur:1.4,ph:.09,sh:\"#1b3a5c\"};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n  document.getElementById('row').innerHTML=[...state.text].map((ch,i)=>'<span style=\"--i:'+i+'\">'+(ch===' '?'&nbsp;':ch)+'</span>').join('');\n}\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M238","标题":"掉落文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["掉落","入场","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Falling Text 让字母从上落下；本库零依赖原生 CSS 关键帧错位","效果演示":"assets/demos/掉落文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"FALLING","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#ffe08a","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#000000","类型":"颜色","说明":"阴影色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e16","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"fs","默认":96,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":2.4,"类型":"数字","说明":"掉落周期(s)"},{"键":"gap","默认":0.12,"类型":"数字","说明":"字母错峰(s)"}],"效果说明":"字母依次从上方掉落归位，像字母块落进凹槽，循环入场。适合标题入场；调掉落周期与字母错峰控制节奏。","用法":"做标题入场动画。","提示词":"做一个掉落文字：字母依次从上方掉落归位并循环。用法：标题入场动画。关键参数：文字、文字色、阴影色、背景色、字号、掉落周期、字母错峰。集成步骤：1 逐字拆 span；2 关键帧从 translateY(-140%) 到 0；3 用 animation-delay 按字符索引错峰。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>掉落文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#ffe08a;--c2:#000000;--bg:#0a0e16;--fs:96;--dur:2.4;--gap:0.12}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c);text-shadow:0 calc(var(--fs)*0.04px) 0 var(--c2)}\n.row span{display:inline-block;transform:translateY(-140%);opacity:0;animation:drop calc(var(--dur)*1s) cubic-bezier(.2,1.3,.4,1) infinite}\n@keyframes drop{0%{transform:translateY(-140%);opacity:0}18%{opacity:1}55%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"row\"></div>\n<script>\nconst state={\"text\":\"FALLING\",\"c\":\"#ffe08a\",\"c2\":\"#000000\",\"bg\":\"#0a0e16\",\"fs\":96,\"dur\":2.4,\"gap\":0.12};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\nconst row=document.getElementById('row');row.innerHTML=[...state.text].map((ch,idx)=>'<span style=\"animation-delay:'+(idx*state.gap)+'s\">'+(ch===' '?'&nbsp;':ch)+'</span>').join('');\n}\n\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M239","标题":"闪烁指针文字","适配端":"通用","元素":"文字","风格":"极简瑞士","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["打字机","光标","文字"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Text Cursor 用光标收尾；本库零依赖原生 CSS 错峰淡入上浮（非 JS 逐字增减），与库内 M234「文字轮播」（打字 + 删除循环）机制不同","效果演示":"assets/demos/闪烁指针文字.html","参数":[{"键":"text","默认":"逐字浮现","类型":"字符串","说明":"展示文字"},{"键":"c","默认":"#0f172a","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#f3f5f9","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"fs","默认":60,"类型":"数字","说明":"字号(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":2.6,"类型":"数字","说明":"单字周期(s)"},{"键":"caret","默认":"#ef4444","类型":"颜色","说明":"光标色"}],"效果说明":"每个字错峰淡入上浮、末尾光标独立闪烁，像一行字被逐一点亮。适合副标题或 section 标题；调单字周期与光标色即可。","用法":"hero 区一句话介绍，带输入感。","提示词":"做一个逐字浮现 + 光标文字：每个字错峰淡入上浮、末尾光标独立闪烁。用法：副标题或 section 标题入场。关键参数：文字、文字色、背景色、字号、单字周期、光标色。集成步骤：1 逐字拆 span 并注入 --i 索引；2 用 animation-delay:calc(var(--i)*.07s) 错峰；3 光标用 steps 关键帧闪烁；与\"打字机\"不同，这里不做增删。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>闪烁指针文字</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#0f172a;--bg:#f3f5f9;--fs:60;--dur:2.6;--caret:#ef4444;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.wrap{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:.08em;font-weight:800;font-size:calc(var(--fs)*1px);color:var(--c)}\n.wrap span{display:inline-block;opacity:0;animation:fin calc(var(--dur)*1s) ease infinite;animation-delay:calc(var(--i) * .07s)}\n@keyframes fin{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(.55em)}18%,68%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-.35em)}}\n.car{width:.07em;height:1.05em;background:var(--caret);display:inline-block;animation:blink 1s steps(1) infinite;flex:none}\n@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important}.wrap span{opacity:1}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\"><span id=\"w\"></span><i class=\"car\"></i></div>\n<script>\n// 每个字用 CSS 错峰淡入上浮（非 JS 逐字增减），末尾光标独立闪烁\nconst state={text:\"逐字浮现\",c:\"#0f172a\",bg:\"#f3f5f9\",fs:60,dur:2.6,caret:\"#ef4444\"};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n  document.getElementById('w').innerHTML=[...state.text].map((ch,i)=>'<span style=\"--i:'+i+'\">'+(ch===' '?'&nbsp;':ch)+'</span>').join('');\n}\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M240","标题":"光柱背景","适配端":"通用","元素":"背景氛围","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["光柱","光束","背景"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Light Pillar 用竖向光束；本库零依赖原生 div+渐变","效果演示":"assets/demos/光柱背景.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#7fd1ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"光束色1"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#a78bfa","类型":"颜色","说明":"光束色2"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070a12","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"count","默认":7,"类型":"数字","说明":"光束数量"},{"键":"dur","默认":5,"类型":"数字","说明":"周期(s)"},{"键":"w","默认":60,"类型":"数字","说明":"光束宽度(px)"},{"键":"blur","默认":18,"类型":"数字","说明":"模糊(px)"},{"键":"op","默认":0.5,"类型":"数字","说明":"峰值不透明度"}],"效果说明":"多道竖向光束上下浮动、明灭不定，像舞台侧光扫过。适合暗色背景氛围；调光束数量、宽度与模糊控制舞台感。","用法":"做暗色落地页的背景层。","提示词":"做一个光柱背景：多道竖向渐变光束上下浮动明灭。用法：暗色落地页背景层。关键参数：光束两色、背景色、数量、周期、光束宽度、模糊、峰值不透明度。集成步骤：1 JS 生成 N 个光束 div 并按序定位；2 用负 animation-delay 保证开屏即见；3 渐变 + blur 造光束质感。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>光柱背景</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#7fd1ff;--c2:#a78bfa;--bg:#070a12;--count:7;--dur:5;--w:60;--blur:18;--op:0.5}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.stage{position:fixed;inset:0;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;display:block}\n.beam{position:absolute;top:-20%;width:calc(var(--w)*1px);height:140%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--c),var(--c2),transparent);filter:blur(calc(var(--blur)*1px));opacity:0;animation:rise calc(var(--dur)*1s) ease-in-out infinite}\n@keyframes rise{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20%)}50%{opacity:var(--op)}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-20%)}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\"></div>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#7fd1ff\",\"c2\":\"#a78bfa\",\"bg\":\"#070a12\",\"count\":7,\"dur\":5,\"w\":60,\"blur\":18,\"op\":0.5};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\nconst st=document.getElementById('stage');const n=state.count|0;st.innerHTML='';for(let i=0;i<n;i++){const b=document.createElement('div');b.className='beam';b.style.left=(i*100/n)+'%';b.style.animationDuration=(state.dur*(0.6+Math.random()*0.8))+'s';b.style.animationDelay='-'+(Math.random()*state.dur).toFixed(2)+'s';st.appendChild(b);}\n}\n\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M241","标题":"侧光线背景","适配端":"通用","元素":"背景氛围","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["光线","放射","背景"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 2D Backgrounds 有光线类；本库零依赖原生 repeating-linear-gradient 做**等距平行光条横向扫入**，与库内 M226「光线背景」（conic-gradient 放射状自转）机制不同","效果演示":"assets/demos/侧光线背景.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#8ab4ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"光条色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070a12","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"w","默认":40,"类型":"数字","说明":"光条宽(px)"},{"键":"gap","默认":90,"类型":"数字","说明":"光条间距(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":6,"类型":"数字","说明":"扫过周期(s)"},{"键":"op","默认":0.28,"类型":"数字","说明":"不透明度"}],"效果说明":"等距平行光条整体横向扫过，像透过百叶窗的光，节奏平稳不抢内容。适合暗色背景；调光条宽度、间距与扫过周期即可。","用法":"做暗色背景的氛围层。","提示词":"做一个侧向光条背景：等距平行光条整体横向扫过。用法：暗色背景氛围层。关键参数：光条色、背景色、光条宽、间距、扫过周期、不透明度。集成步骤：1 用 repeating-linear-gradient 造等距光条；2 容器左右各多留一个周期宽；3 平移动画位移一个\"条宽+间距\"实现无缝循环。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>侧光线背景</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#8ab4ff;--bg:#070a12;--w:40;--gap:90;--dur:6;--op:.28;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)}\n.stage{position:fixed;inset:0;overflow:hidden}\n.bars{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:calc(-1 * (var(--w) + var(--gap)) * 1px);\n  width:calc(100% + (var(--w) + var(--gap)) * 1px);\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c) 0 calc(var(--w)*1px), transparent calc(var(--w)*1px) calc((var(--w) + var(--gap))*1px));\n  opacity:var(--op);animation:sweep calc(var(--dur)*1s) linear infinite}\n@keyframes sweep{to{transform:translateX(calc((var(--w) + var(--gap))*1px))}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"stage\"><div class=\"bars\"></div></div>\n<script>\n// 等距平行光条整体横向扫过（平移一个\"条宽+间距\"即无缝循环），与放射状光线机制不同\nconst state={c:\"#8ab4ff\",bg:\"#070a12\",w:40,gap:90,dur:6,op:.28};\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n}\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M242","标题":"浮动线条背景","适配端":"通用","元素":"背景氛围","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["线条","漂移","背景"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 2D Backgrounds 用漂浮线条；本库零依赖原生 canvas","效果演示":"assets/demos/浮动线条背景.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#7fd1ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"线条色1"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#f0a6ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"线条色2"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#060910","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"n","默认":60,"类型":"数字","说明":"线条数量"},{"键":"sp","默认":0.4,"类型":"数字","说明":"速度"},{"键":"op","默认":0.5,"类型":"数字","说明":"不透明度"}],"效果说明":"细线条在画布上缓慢漂移、邻近自动连线，织成一张会呼吸的网。适合科技/数据类背景；调线条数量与连线距离控制密度。","用法":"做暗色背景的轻量氛围层（不抢内容）。","提示词":"做一个浮动线条背景：大量细点在画布漂移、邻近自动连线。用法：科技/数据类暗色背景。关键参数：线条两色、背景色、点数量、速度、不透明度。集成步骤：1 canvas 生成 N 个带速度的点；2 每帧按距离阈值连线；3 距离越近线越亮，形成呼吸的网。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>浮动线条背景</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#7fd1ff;--c2:#f0a6ff;--bg:#060910;--n:60;--sp:0.4;--op:0.5}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\ncanvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#7fd1ff\",\"c2\":\"#f0a6ff\",\"bg\":\"#060910\",\"n\":60,\"sp\":0.4,\"op\":0.5};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');let W,H,pts;\nfunction rs(){W=cv.width=innerWidth;H=cv.height=innerHeight;pts=[];for(let i=0;i<state.n;i++)pts.push({x:Math.random()*W,y:Math.random()*H,vx:(Math.random()-.5)*state.sp,vy:(Math.random()-.5)*state.sp});}\nrs();addEventListener('resize',rs);\nconst col=a=>a<0.5?state.c:state.c2;\nfunction loop(){ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);ctx.globalAlpha=state.op;ctx.lineWidth=1;\n for(let i=0;i<pts.length;i++){const p=pts[i];p.x+=p.vx;p.y+=p.vy;if(p.x<0||p.x>W)p.vx*=-1;if(p.y<0||p.y>H)p.vy*=-1;ctx.strokeStyle=col(i/pts.length);ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(p.x,p.y);\n  for(let j=i+1;j<pts.length;j++){const q=pts[j];const d=Math.hypot(p.x-q.x,p.y-q.y);if(d<140){ctx.globalAlpha=state.op*(1-d/140);ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(p.x,p.y);ctx.lineTo(q.x,q.y);ctx.stroke();}}\n  ctx.globalAlpha=state.op;ctx.fillStyle=col(i/pts.length);ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,1.6,0,7);ctx.fill();}\n requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M243","标题":"像素雪花背景","适配端":"通用","元素":"背景氛围","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["像素","雪花","背景"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Pixel Snow 用像素方块飘落；本库零依赖原生 canvas","效果演示":"assets/demos/像素雪花背景.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#eaf6ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"雪花色1"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#9fd0ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"雪花色2"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070b14","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"n","默认":140,"类型":"数字","说明":"雪花数量"},{"键":"sp","默认":0.6,"类型":"数字","说明":"速度"},{"键":"size","默认":5,"类型":"数字","说明":"方块边长(px)"}],"效果说明":"像素方块像雪一样飘落并带轻微横向摇摆，复古颗粒感十足。适合冬季/像素风背景；调雪花数量、大小与速度控制密度。","用法":"做冬季/节日或像素风暗色背景。","提示词":"做一个像素雪花背景：像素方块飘落并轻微左右摇摆。用法：冬季/像素风暗色背景。关键参数：雪花两色、背景色、数量、速度、方块边长。集成步骤：1 canvas 维护雪花数组；2 每帧下移 + 正弦横移；3 落底后回到顶部复用，随机大小增强层次。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>像素雪花背景</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#eaf6ff;--c2:#9fd0ff;--bg:#070b14;--n:140;--sp:0.6;--size:5}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\ncanvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#eaf6ff\",\"c2\":\"#9fd0ff\",\"bg\":\"#070b14\",\"n\":140,\"sp\":0.6,\"size\":5};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');let W,H,fl;\nfunction rs(){W=cv.width=innerWidth;H=cv.height=innerHeight;fl=[];for(let i=0;i<state.n;i++)fl.push({x:Math.random()*W,y:Math.random()*H,r:state.size*(0.5+Math.random()),s:state.sp*(0.5+Math.random()),d:Math.random()*7});}\nrs();addEventListener('resize',rs);\nfunction loop(){ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);for(const f of fl){f.y+=f.s;f.x+=Math.sin(f.y/60+f.d)*0.3;if(f.y>H){f.y=-f.r;f.x=Math.random()*W;}ctx.fillStyle=Math.random()<0.5?state.c:state.c2;ctx.fillRect(f.x|0,f.y|0,f.r,f.r);}requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M244","标题":"魔法光环","适配端":"PC 端","元素":"动效","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["光环","鼠标","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Magic Rings 用跟随鼠标的光环；本库零依赖原生 canvas","效果演示":"assets/demos/魔法光环.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#9b8cff","类型":"颜色","说明":"光环色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070a12","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"rings","默认":5,"类型":"数字","说明":"光环数"},{"键":"lag","默认":0.18,"类型":"数字","说明":"跟随延迟"},{"键":"size","默认":26,"类型":"数字","说明":"间距(px)"},{"键":"trail","默认":0.12,"类型":"数字","说明":"拖影"}],"效果说明":"鼠标拖出一圈带延迟的同心光环，越外圈越滞后，像魔法阵。核心交互依赖光标，触摸端不可达，故判 PC 端；调环数与跟随延迟控制韵律。","用法":"做暗色页的鼠标互动装饰。","提示词":"做一个魔法光环：鼠标拖动带延迟的同心光环跟随。用法：暗色页鼠标互动装饰（依赖光标，判 PC 端）。关键参数：光环色、背景色、环数、跟随延迟、间距、拖影。集成步骤：1 canvas 维护多层光环坐标；2 每帧按延迟系数向鼠标插值；3 环半径按层数递增，外圈更滞后。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>魔法光环</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#9b8cff;--bg:#070a12;--rings:5;--lag:0.18;--size:26;--trail:0.12}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\ncanvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#9b8cff\",\"bg\":\"#070a12\",\"rings\":5,\"lag\":0.18,\"size\":26,\"trail\":0.12};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');let W,H;function rs(){W=cv.width=innerWidth;H=cv.height=innerHeight;}rs();addEventListener('resize',rs);\nlet cx=mx,cy=my;const ring=[];for(let i=0;i<state.rings;i++)ring.push({x:mx,y:my});\nfunction loop(){cx+=(mx-cx)*state.lag;cy+=(my-cy)*state.lag;for(let i=0;i<ring.length;i++){ring[i].x+=(cx-ring[i].x)*state.lag;ring[i].y+=(cy-ring[i].y)*state.lag;}\n ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.globalAlpha=1;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);ctx.globalAlpha=state.trail;ctx.strokeStyle=state.c;ctx.lineWidth=2;\n for(let i=0;i<ring.length;i++){const r=(i+1)*state.size;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(ring[i].x,ring[i].y,r,0,7);ctx.stroke();}requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M245","标题":"幽灵光标","适配端":"PC 端","元素":"动效","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["幽灵","拖影","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Ghost Cursor 用一串延迟残影；本库零依赖原生 canvas","效果演示":"assets/demos/幽灵光标.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#7fe9d0","类型":"颜色","说明":"残影色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070a12","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"count","默认":14,"类型":"数字","说明":"残影数"},{"键":"sp","默认":0.35,"类型":"数字","说明":"跟随速度"},{"键":"size","默认":14,"类型":"数字","说明":"残影大小(px)"},{"键":"op","默认":0.85,"类型":"数字","说明":"残影不透明度"}],"效果说明":"鼠标后跟一串越来越淡、越来越小的残影，像幽灵尾随。核心交互依赖光标，触摸端不可达，故判 PC 端；调残影数与跟随速度控制浓度。","用法":"做暗色页的趣味鼠标互动。","提示词":"做一个幽灵光标：鼠标后跟一串渐隐渐小的残影。用法：暗色页趣味鼠标互动（依赖光标，判 PC 端）。关键参数：残影色、背景色、残影数、跟随速度、残影大小、不透明度。集成步骤：1 用数组存残影坐标；2 每帧让后一格追前一格；3 按索引递减半径与透明度。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>幽灵光标</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#7fe9d0;--bg:#070a12;--count:14;--sp:0.35;--size:14;--op:0.85}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\ncanvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#7fe9d0\",\"bg\":\"#070a12\",\"count\":14,\"sp\":0.35,\"size\":14,\"op\":0.85};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');let W,H;function rs(){W=cv.width=innerWidth;H=cv.height=innerHeight;}rs();addEventListener('resize',rs);\nconst g=[];for(let i=0;i<state.count;i++)g.push({x:mx,y:my});\nfunction loop(){for(let i=0;i<g.length;i++){g[i].x+=( (i===0?mx:g[i-1].x) -g[i].x)*state.sp;g[i].y+=( (i===0?my:g[i-1].y) -g[i].y)*state.sp;}\n ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);for(let i=0;i<g.length;i++){ctx.globalAlpha=(1-i/g.length)*state.op;ctx.fillStyle=state.c;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(g[i].x,g[i].y,state.size*(1-i/g.length*0.5),0,7);ctx.fill();}requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M246","标题":"十字准星光标","适配端":"PC 端","元素":"动效","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["十字","准星","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Crosshair 用跟随鼠标的十字线；本库零依赖原生 canvas","效果演示":"assets/demos/十字准星光标.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#ff6b6b","类型":"颜色","说明":"准星色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070a12","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"op","默认":0.7,"类型":"数字","说明":"不透明度"},{"键":"thick","默认":2,"类型":"数字","说明":"线宽(px)"},{"键":"gap","默认":26,"类型":"数字","说明":"中心缺口(px)"},{"键":"size","默认":26,"类型":"数字","说明":"中心环半径(px)"}],"效果说明":"全屏十字线跟随鼠标、中心留缺口并带瞄准圆环，像射击准星。核心交互依赖光标，触摸端不可达，故判 PC 端；调线宽、缺口与环半径即可。","用法":"做\"瞄准/精准\"主题的暗色页装饰。","提示词":"做一个十字准星光标：全屏十字线跟随鼠标、中心留缺口带小圆环。用法：\"瞄准/精准\"主题暗色页装饰（依赖光标，判 PC 端）。关键参数：准星色、背景色、不透明度、线宽、中心缺口、中心环半径。集成步骤：1 canvas 每帧清屏并画四条线到鼠标；2 中心画一个圆环；3 线宽与缺口可调。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>十字准星光标</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#ff6b6b;--bg:#070a12;--op:0.7;--thick:2;--gap:26;--size:26}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\ncanvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#ff6b6b\",\"bg\":\"#070a12\",\"op\":0.7,\"thick\":2,\"gap\":26,\"size\":26};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');let W,H;function rs(){W=cv.width=innerWidth;H=cv.height=innerHeight;}rs();addEventListener('resize',rs);\nfunction loop(){ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);ctx.globalAlpha=state.op;ctx.strokeStyle=state.c;ctx.lineWidth=state.thick;\n ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(0,my);ctx.lineTo(mx-state.gap,my);ctx.moveTo(mx+state.gap,my);ctx.lineTo(W,my);ctx.moveTo(mx,0);ctx.lineTo(mx,my-state.gap);ctx.moveTo(mx,my+state.gap);ctx.lineTo(mx,H);ctx.stroke();\n ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(mx,my,state.size,0,7);ctx.stroke();requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M247","标题":"飞溅光标","适配端":"通用","元素":"动效","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["飞溅","粒子","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Splash Cursor 点击溅出粒子；本库零依赖原生 canvas","效果演示":"assets/demos/飞溅光标.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#ffd166","类型":"颜色","说明":"粒子色1"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#ef476f","类型":"颜色","说明":"粒子色2"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070a12","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"count","默认":24,"类型":"数字","说明":"每溅粒子数"},{"键":"size","默认":4,"类型":"数字","说明":"粒子大小(px)"},{"键":"speed","默认":6,"类型":"数字","说明":"初速"},{"键":"gravity","默认":0.18,"类型":"数字","说明":"重力"}],"效果说明":"点击处溅出一束带重力的粒子，随重力下坠并缩小消失。适合点击反馈；pointerdown 触摸端同样可触发，判通用；调粒子数与初速控制爆发力。","用法":"做暗色页点击反馈装饰。","提示词":"做一个飞溅光标：点击处迸发一束受重力的粒子。用法：页面点击反馈装饰（pointerdown 触摸端也可触发，判通用）。关键参数：粒子两色、背景色、每溅粒子数、粒子大小、初速、重力。集成步骤：1 pointerdown 时按角度生成粒子；2 每帧施加重力并衰减半径；3 出界或过小即回收。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>飞溅光标</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#ffd166;--c2:#ef476f;--bg:#070a12;--count:24;--size:4;--speed:6;--gravity:0.18}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\ncanvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block;cursor:crosshair}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#ffd166\",\"c2\":\"#ef476f\",\"bg\":\"#070a12\",\"count\":24,\"size\":4,\"speed\":6,\"gravity\":0.18};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');let W,H,ps=[];function rs(){W=cv.width=innerWidth;H=cv.height=innerHeight;}rs();addEventListener('resize',rs);\naddEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{for(let i=0;i<state.count;i++){const a=Math.random()*7,sp=state.speed*(0.4+Math.random());ps.push({x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY,vx:Math.cos(a)*sp,vy:Math.sin(a)*sp-2,r:state.size*(0.6+Math.random()),c:Math.random()<0.5?state.c:state.c2});}});\nfunction loop(){ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);for(let i=ps.length-1;i>=0;i--){const p=ps[i];p.vy+=state.gravity;p.x+=p.vx;p.y+=p.vy;p.r*=0.98;if(p.r<0.4||p.y>H+20){ps.splice(i,1);continue;}ctx.fillStyle=p.c;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,p.r,0,7);ctx.fill();}requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M249","标题":"磁铁线条","适配端":"PC 端","元素":"动效","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["磁铁","连线","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Magnet Lines 用连向鼠标的线；本库零依赖原生 canvas","效果演示":"assets/demos/磁铁线条.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#b794f6","类型":"颜色","说明":"线条色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070a12","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"n","默认":26,"类型":"数字","说明":"点数"},{"键":"len","默认":120,"类型":"数字","说明":"线长(px)"},{"键":"snap","默认":160,"类型":"数字","说明":"吸附半径(px)"},{"键":"size","默认":2.4,"类型":"数字","说明":"端点半径(px)"}],"效果说明":"画布上的固定点，靠近鼠标的会产生连线并被\"吸\"向光标，像磁力线。核心交互依赖光标，触摸端不可达，故判 PC 端；调点数与吸附半径控制强度。","用法":"做暗色背景的鼠标互动装饰。","提示词":"做一个磁铁线条：画布固定点靠近鼠标时被线\"吸\"过来。用法：暗色背景的鼠标互动装饰（依赖光标，判 PC 端）。关键参数：线条色、背景色、点数、吸附半径、端点半径。集成步骤：1 生成随机基点；2 每帧按到鼠标距离求吸附权重并插值端点；3 画基点到底点的连线与端点。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>磁铁线条</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#b794f6;--bg:#070a12;--n:26;--len:120;--snap:160;--size:2.4}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\ncanvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#b794f6\",\"bg\":\"#070a12\",\"n\":26,\"len\":120,\"snap\":160,\"size\":2.4};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');let W,H,pts;function rs(){W=cv.width=innerWidth;H=cv.height=innerHeight;pts=[];for(let i=0;i<state.n;i++)pts.push({x:Math.random()*W,y:Math.random()*H,bx:Math.random()*W,by:Math.random()*H});}rs();addEventListener('resize',rs);\nfunction loop(){ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);ctx.strokeStyle=state.c;ctx.lineWidth=1.4;\n for(const p of pts){const d=Math.hypot(p.bx-mx,p.by-my);const t=Math.min(1,state.snap/(d+1));const ex=p.bx+(mx-p.bx)*t,ey=p.by+(my-p.by)*t;\n  p.x+=(ex-p.x)*0.2;p.y+=(ey-p.y)*0.2;ctx.globalAlpha=0.25+t*0.6;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(p.bx,p.by);ctx.lineTo(p.x,p.y);ctx.stroke();\n  ctx.globalAlpha=0.8;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,state.size,0,7);ctx.fillStyle=state.c;ctx.fill();}requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M250","标题":"辉光悬停","适配端":"PC 端","元素":"动效","风格":"玻璃拟态","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["辉光","悬停","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Glare Hover 用跟随鼠标的高光；本库零依赖原生径向渐变","效果演示":"assets/demos/辉光悬停.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#ffffff","类型":"颜色","说明":"高光色"},{"键":"card","默认":"#1b2440","类型":"颜色","说明":"卡片色"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#0a0e1a","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"glare","默认":220,"类型":"数字","说明":"光斑半径(px)"},{"键":"op","默认":0.5,"类型":"数字","说明":"高光强度"},{"键":"txt","默认":"#cdd6ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"文字色"}],"效果说明":"卡片上跟随鼠标的高光扫过，像被一束光掠过，玻璃质感更强。核心交互依赖 hover，触摸端不可达，故判 PC 端；调光斑半径与强度控制光泽。","用法":"给卡片/按钮加高级悬停光泽。","提示词":"做一个辉光悬停：卡片上跟随鼠标的高光扫过。用法：卡片/按钮高级悬停光泽（依赖 hover，判 PC 端）。关键参数：高光色、卡片色、背景色、光斑半径、高光强度、文字色。集成步骤：1 卡片内叠一层 radial-gradient 高光；2 mousemove 写 --gx/--gy 定位光心；3 hover 时切换高光透明度。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>辉光悬停</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#ffffff;--card:#1b2440;--bg:#0a0e1a;--glare:220;--op:0.5;--txt:#cdd6ff}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.wrap{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.card{position:relative;width:min(80vw,420px);height:260px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--card);overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--txt,#cdd6ff);font-weight:800;font-size:28px;cursor:pointer}\n.card .gl{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle calc(var(--glare)*1px) at var(--gx,50%) var(--gy,50%), color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) calc(var(--op)*100%), transparent), transparent 70%);opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s;pointer-events:none}\n.card:hover .gl{opacity:1}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"card\" id=\"card\"><div class=\"gl\" id=\"gl\"></div><span>HOVER ME</span></div></div>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#ffffff\",\"card\":\"#1b2440\",\"bg\":\"#0a0e1a\",\"glare\":220,\"op\":0.5,\"txt\":\"#cdd6ff\"};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst card=document.getElementById('card'),gl=document.getElementById('gl');\ncard.addEventListener('mousemove',e=>{const r=card.getBoundingClientRect();const x=((e.clientX-r.left)/r.width*100).toFixed(1),y=((e.clientY-r.top)/r.height*100).toFixed(1);gl.style.setProperty('--gx',x+'%');gl.style.setProperty('--gy',y+'%');});\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M251","标题":"像素交换","适配端":"通用","元素":"动效","风格":"暗色","场景":"落地页·发布页","标签":["像素","网格","动效"],"来源":"① 具体网站 reactbits.dev（源 GitHub DavidHDev/react-bits，MIT + Commons Clause，已用原生 JS 重实现，非搬运源码）：原站 Pixel Swap 用网格像素随机换位；本库零依赖原生 canvas","效果演示":"assets/demos/像素交换.html","参数":[{"键":"c","默认":"#5eead4","类型":"颜色","说明":"像素色1"},{"键":"c2","默认":"#818cf8","类型":"颜色","说明":"像素色2"},{"键":"bg","默认":"#070a12","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"cols","默认":22,"类型":"数字","说明":"列数"},{"键":"rows","默认":14,"类型":"数字","说明":"行数"},{"键":"sp","默认":0.18,"类型":"数字","说明":"交换间隔(s)"},{"键":"size","默认":8,"类型":"数字","说明":"像素(px)"}],"效果说明":"网格像素定时两两交换颜色，像信号在重组、又像马赛克呼吸。适合暗色故障/像素氛围；调行列数、交换间隔与像素尺寸即可。","用法":"做暗色背景的故障/重组氛围。","提示词":"做一个像素交换：网格像素定时两两交换颜色。用法：暗色故障/像素风背景。关键参数：像素两色、背景色、列数、行数、交换间隔、像素尺寸。集成步骤：1 canvas 按行列铺格并随机上色；2 定时器递归随机交换两格颜色；3 每帧按网格重绘。","代码":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>像素交换</title>\n<style>\n:root{--c:#5eead4;--c2:#818cf8;--bg:#070a12;--cols:22;--rows:14;--sp:0.18;--size:8}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0a0e16);font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}\ncanvas{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<canvas id=\"cv\"></canvas>\n<script>\nconst state={\"c\":\"#5eead4\",\"c2\":\"#818cf8\",\"bg\":\"#070a12\",\"cols\":22,\"rows\":14,\"sp\":0.18,\"size\":8};\nlet mx=innerWidth/2,my=innerHeight/2,wheel=0;\naddEventListener('mousemove',e=>{mx=e.clientX;my=e.clientY;});\naddEventListener('wheel',e=>{wheel+=e.deltaY;},{passive:true});\nfunction apply(){\n  const r=document.documentElement.style;\n  for(const k in state){ r.setProperty('--'+k, state[k]); }\n\n}\nconst cv=document.getElementById('cv'),ctx=cv.getContext('2d');let W,H,grid,timer;\nfunction build(){W=cv.width=innerWidth;H=cv.height=innerHeight;grid=[];for(let y=0;y<state.rows;y++)for(let x=0;x<state.cols;x++)grid.push({x,y,c:Math.random()<0.5?state.c:state.c2});}\nfunction draw(){ctx.fillStyle=state.bg;ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);const cw=W/state.cols,ch=H/state.rows;const s=Math.min(state.size,cw,ch)*0.82;for(const p of grid){ctx.fillStyle=p.c;ctx.fillRect(p.x*cw+(cw-s)/2,p.y*ch+(ch-s)/2,s,s);}}\nfunction swap(){if(grid.length>1){const a=(Math.random()*grid.length)|0,b=(Math.random()*grid.length)|0;const t=grid[a].c;grid[a].c=grid[b].c;grid[b].c=t;}draw();timer=setTimeout(swap,state.sp*1000);}\nbuild();draw();swap();addEventListener('resize',()=>{clearTimeout(timer);build();draw();swap();});\napply();\naddEventListener('message',e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!=='param')return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M252","标题":"分层拉开","标签":["3D","结构展示","分层"],"效果演示":"assets/demos/分层拉开.html","参数":[{"键":"bg","默认":"#0b1020","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"panel","默认":"#1b3a6b","类型":"颜色","说明":"层色"},{"键":"accent","默认":"#5fd0ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"对应连线色"},{"键":"gap","默认":70,"类型":"数字","说明":"拉开间距(px)"},{"键":"tilt","默认":28,"类型":"数字","说明":"倾角(deg)"},{"键":"dur","默认":6,"类型":"数字","说明":"周期(s)"},{"键":"radius","默认":12,"类型":"数字","说明":"圆角(px)"}],"效果说明":"把界面分成四层并沿 Z 轴拉开间距，每层保留自身内容与左侧对应连线，直观展示层级关系与对应关系。自动循环播放，不依赖 hover。","用法":"讲解信息架构、页面层级、模块化拆分时使用。","提示词":"把界面分成四层，拉开间距，保留每层内容和对应关系。用法：展示界面层级/信息架构。关键参数：背景色、层色、对应连线色、拉开间距、倾角、周期、圆角。集成步骤：1 建透视舞台与 4 个层；2 按索引算 Y 偏移并叠加 Z 深度；3 用 sin 相位循环拉开/合拢间距。","代码":"\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>分层拉开</title>\\n<style>\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0b1020);font-family:system-ui,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif}\\n:root{--bg:#0b1020;--panel:#1b3a6b;--accent:#5fd0ff;--gap:70;--tilt:28;--dur:6;--radius:12}\\n.stage{position:relative;width:340px;height:300px;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(calc(var(--tilt)*1deg))}\\n.guide{position:absolute;left:18px;top:10px;bottom:10px;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(var(--accent,#5fd0ff),transparent);opacity:.5}\\n.layer{position:absolute;left:40px;width:260px;height:54px;border-radius:calc(var(--radius)*1px);background:var(--panel,#1b3a6b);color:#dceaff;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 16px;gap:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}\\n.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent,#5fd0ff);flex:0 0 auto}\\n.lt{font-weight:800;font-size:14px}\\n.ls{font-size:11px;opacity:.7;margin-left:auto}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div class=\\\"stage\\\" id=\\\"stage\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"guide\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"layer\\\" data-i=\\\"0\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\"></span><span class=\\\"lt\\\">层 1 · 顶栏</span><span class=\\\"ls\\\">导航</span></div>\\n<div class=\\\"layer\\\" data-i=\\\"1\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\"></span><span class=\\\"lt\\\">层 2 · 内容</span><span class=\\\"ls\\\">正文</span></div>\\n<div class=\\\"layer\\\" data-i=\\\"2\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\"></span><span class=\\\"lt\\\">层 3 · 侧栏</span><span class=\\\"ls\\\">工具</span></div>\\n<div class=\\\"layer\\\" data-i=\\\"3\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\"></span><span class=\\\"lt\\\">层 4 · 底栏</span><span class=\\\"ls\\\">操作</span></div>\\n</div>\\n<script>\\nconst state={\\\"bg\\\":\\\"#0b1020\\\",\\\"panel\\\":\\\"#1b3a6b\\\",\\\"accent\\\":\\\"#5fd0ff\\\",\\\"gap\\\":70,\\\"tilt\\\":28,\\\"dur\\\":6,\\\"radius\\\":12};\\nfunction apply(){const r=document.documentElement.style;r.setProperty(\\\"--bg\\\",state.bg);r.setProperty(\\\"--panel\\\",state.panel);r.setProperty(\\\"--accent\\\",state.accent);r.setProperty(\\\"--gap\\\",state.gap);r.setProperty(\\\"--tilt\\\",state.tilt);r.setProperty(\\\"--dur\\\",state.dur);r.setProperty(\\\"--radius\\\",state.radius);}\\nconst layers=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(\\\".layer\\\"));const N=layers.length;\\nfunction draw(t){const e=Math.sin(t*Math.PI*2)*0.5+0.5;const base=34,sp=base+e*state.gap;layers.forEach(function(el,i){const y=(i-(N-1)/2)*sp;el.style.transform=\\\"translateY(\\\"+y+\\\"px) translateZ(\\\"+(i*18)+\\\"px)\\\";});}\\nconst reduce=matchMedia(\\\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\\\").matches;\\nfunction frame(now){const t=(now/1000/state.dur)%1;draw(t);if(!reduce)requestAnimationFrame(frame);}\\napply();if(reduce)draw(0.5);else requestAnimationFrame(frame);\\naddEventListener(\\\"message\\\",e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!==\\\"param\\\")return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"","适配端":"通用","元素":"动效","风格":"科技未来","场景":"官网·品牌站","来源":"④ 来自于抖音（用户收藏夹 modal_id=7687230787947815289）：6 个「立体结构展示动效」的 AI 提示词模板——分层拉开 / 零件爆炸展开 / 局部剖开 / 切面扫描 / 透视显露内部 / 路径装配；本库零依赖原生 CSS 3D 重实现（非搬运源码、无外链、无框架）；机制指纹（爆炸 / 剖开 / 切面 / 透视 / 装配 / 分层拉开）在库内 0 命中，属新机制，故入素材库","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M253","标题":"零件爆炸展开","标签":["3D","爆炸","装配"],"效果演示":"assets/demos/零件爆炸展开.html","参数":[{"键":"bg","默认":"#0b1020","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"shell","默认":"#2b6cb0","类型":"颜色","说明":"外壳色"},{"键":"core","默认":"#ffce5a","类型":"颜色","说明":"内核色"},{"键":"dist","默认":95,"类型":"数字","说明":"爆炸距离(px)"},{"键":"dur","默认":7,"类型":"数字","说明":"周期(s)"},{"键":"spin","默认":22,"类型":"数字","说明":"自转(deg/s)"},{"键":"radius","默认":10,"类型":"数字","说明":"圆角(px)"}],"效果说明":"六个外壳面沿法线向外炸开露出内部内核，停在看得清的爆炸位，再合拢复位，循环演示。自动播放，不依赖 hover。","用法":"展示产品零件构成、硬件爆炸图、内部结构讲解。","提示词":"把零件分别拆开，露出内部，最后停在看得清的位置。用法：产品零件爆炸图/内部结构。关键参数：背景色、外壳色、内核色、爆炸距离、周期、自转、圆角。集成步骤：1 六面体+内核；2 每面沿法线 translateZ 加 e*距离；3 相位 0→1 炸开、中段停顿、1→0 合拢。","代码":"\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>零件爆炸展开</title>\\n<style>\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0b1020);font-family:system-ui,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif}\\n:root{--bg:#0b1020;--shell:#2b6cb0;--core:#ffce5a;--dist:95;--dur:7;--spin:22;--radius:10}\\n.scene{width:200px;height:200px;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:perspective(900px)}\\n.box{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-style:preserve-3d}\\n.face{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:120px;height:120px;margin:-60px 0 0 -60px;border-radius:calc(var(--radius)*1px);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--shell) 80%,transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)}\\n.core{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:46px;height:46px;margin:-23px 0 0 -23px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--core,#ffce5a);box-shadow:0 0 30px var(--core,#ffce5a)}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div class=\\\"scene\\\"><div class=\\\"box\\\" id=\\\"box\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" data-r=\\\"\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" data-r=\\\"rotateY(180deg)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" data-r=\\\"rotateY(90deg)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" data-r=\\\"rotateY(-90deg)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" data-r=\\\"rotateX(90deg)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" data-r=\\\"rotateX(-90deg)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"core\\\" id=\\\"core\\\"></div>\\n</div></div>\\n<script>\\nconst state={\\\"bg\\\":\\\"#0b1020\\\",\\\"shell\\\":\\\"#2b6cb0\\\",\\\"core\\\":\\\"#ffce5a\\\",\\\"dist\\\":95,\\\"dur\\\":7,\\\"spin\\\":22,\\\"radius\\\":10};\\nfunction apply(){const r=document.documentElement.style;r.setProperty(\\\"--bg\\\",state.bg);r.setProperty(\\\"--shell\\\",state.shell);r.setProperty(\\\"--core\\\",state.core);r.setProperty(\\\"--dist\\\",state.dist);r.setProperty(\\\"--dur\\\",state.dur);r.setProperty(\\\"--spin\\\",state.spin);r.setProperty(\\\"--radius\\\",state.radius);}\\nconst box=document.getElementById(\\\"box\\\"),core=document.getElementById(\\\"core\\\");const faces=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(\\\".face\\\"));const half=60;let ang=0;\\nfunction draw(t){const e=t<0.4?t/0.4:t<0.7?1:1-(t-0.7)/0.3;ang+=state.spin/60;const tz=half+e*state.dist;faces.forEach(function(f){f.style.transform=f.dataset.r+\\\" translateZ(\\\"+tz+\\\"px)\\\";});core.style.transform=\\\"scale(1)\\\";box.style.transform=\\\"rotateX(-18deg) rotateY(\\\"+ang+\\\"deg)\\\";}\\nconst reduce=matchMedia(\\\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\\\").matches;\\nfunction frame(now){const t=(now/1000/state.dur)%1;draw(t);if(!reduce)requestAnimationFrame(frame);}\\napply();if(reduce)draw(0.5);else requestAnimationFrame(frame);\\naddEventListener(\\\"message\\\",e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!==\\\"param\\\")return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"","适配端":"通用","元素":"动效","风格":"科技未来","场景":"官网·品牌站","来源":"④ 来自于抖音（用户收藏夹 modal_id=7687230787947815289）：6 个「立体结构展示动效」的 AI 提示词模板——分层拉开 / 零件爆炸展开 / 局部剖开 / 切面扫描 / 透视显露内部 / 路径装配；本库零依赖原生 CSS 3D 重实现（非搬运源码、无外链、无框架）；机制指纹（爆炸 / 剖开 / 切面 / 透视 / 装配 / 分层拉开）在库内 0 命中，属新机制，故入素材库","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M254","标题":"局部剖开","标签":["3D","剖开","结构展示"],"效果演示":"assets/demos/局部剖开.html","参数":[{"键":"bg","默认":"#0b1020","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"shell","默认":"#2b6cb0","类型":"颜色","说明":"外壳色"},{"键":"inner","默认":"#ffce5a","类型":"颜色","说明":"内部模块色"},{"键":"door","默认":"#7aa7ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"门板色"},{"键":"open","默认":115,"类型":"数字","说明":"开启角(deg)"},{"键":"dur","默认":6,"类型":"数字","说明":"周期(s)"},{"键":"radius","默认":10,"类型":"数字","说明":"圆角(px)"}],"效果说明":"外壳正面作为门板绕左侧铰链向外打开，露出内部模块，其余五面结构保持不动，循环演示开合。自动播放，不依赖 hover。","用法":"展示带外壳设备的内部模块、局部细节特写。","提示词":"打开一块外壳，其余结构不动露出里面的模块。用法：查看指定区域内部。关键参数：背景色、外壳色、内部模块色、门板色、开启角、周期、圆角。集成步骤：1 五面静态壳+正面门板(transform-origin 左中)；2 门板 rotateY 由 0 开到开启角；3 内部模块常显于中心。","代码":"\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>局部剖开</title>\\n<style>\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0b1020);font-family:system-ui,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif}\\n:root{--bg:#0b1020;--shell:#2b6cb0;--inner:#ffce5a;--door:#7aa7ff;--open:115;--dur:6;--radius:10}\\n.scene{width:200px;height:200px;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(-12deg) rotateY(-22deg)}\\n.box{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-style:preserve-3d}\\n.face{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:120px;height:120px;margin:-60px 0 0 -60px;border-radius:calc(var(--radius)*1px);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--shell) 82%,transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)}\\n.door{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:120px;height:120px;margin:-60px 0 0 -60px;border-radius:calc(var(--radius)*1px);background:var(--door,#7aa7ff);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);transform-origin:left center}\\n.module{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:54px;height:54px;margin:-27px 0 0 -27px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--inner,#ffce5a);box-shadow:0 0 26px var(--inner,#ffce5a)}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div class=\\\"scene\\\"><div class=\\\"box\\\" id=\\\"box\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" style=\\\"transform:rotateY(180deg) translateZ(60px)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" style=\\\"transform:rotateY(90deg) translateZ(60px)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" style=\\\"transform:rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(60px)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" style=\\\"transform:rotateX(90deg) translateZ(60px)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"face\\\" style=\\\"transform:rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(60px)\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"module\\\" id=\\\"module\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"door\\\" id=\\\"door\\\" style=\\\"transform:translateZ(60px)\\\"></div>\\n</div></div>\\n<script>\\nconst state={\\\"bg\\\":\\\"#0b1020\\\",\\\"shell\\\":\\\"#2b6cb0\\\",\\\"inner\\\":\\\"#ffce5a\\\",\\\"door\\\":\\\"#7aa7ff\\\",\\\"open\\\":115,\\\"dur\\\":6,\\\"radius\\\":10};\\nfunction apply(){const r=document.documentElement.style;r.setProperty(\\\"--bg\\\",state.bg);r.setProperty(\\\"--shell\\\",state.shell);r.setProperty(\\\"--inner\\\",state.inner);r.setProperty(\\\"--door\\\",state.door);r.setProperty(\\\"--open\\\",state.open);r.setProperty(\\\"--dur\\\",state.dur);r.setProperty(\\\"--radius\\\",state.radius);}\\nconst door=document.getElementById(\\\"door\\\");\\nfunction draw(t){const o=t<0.35?t/0.35:t<0.7?1:1-(t-0.7)/0.3;const deg=o*state.open;door.style.transform=\\\"translateZ(60px) rotateY(\\\"+(-deg)+\\\"deg)\\\";}\\nconst reduce=matchMedia(\\\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\\\").matches;\\nfunction frame(now){const t=(now/1000/state.dur)%1;draw(t);if(!reduce)requestAnimationFrame(frame);}\\napply();if(reduce)draw(0.5);else requestAnimationFrame(frame);\\naddEventListener(\\\"message\\\",e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!==\\\"param\\\")return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"","适配端":"通用","元素":"动效","风格":"科技未来","场景":"官网·品牌站","来源":"④ 来自于抖音（用户收藏夹 modal_id=7687230787947815289）：6 个「立体结构展示动效」的 AI 提示词模板——分层拉开 / 零件爆炸展开 / 局部剖开 / 切面扫描 / 透视显露内部 / 路径装配；本库零依赖原生 CSS 3D 重实现（非搬运源码、无外链、无框架）；机制指纹（爆炸 / 剖开 / 切面 / 透视 / 装配 / 分层拉开）在库内 0 命中，属新机制，故入素材库","复用记录":""},
{"id":"M255","标题":"切面扫描","标签":["3D","扫描","截面"],"效果演示":"assets/demos/切面扫描.html","参数":[{"键":"bg","默认":"#0b1020","类型":"颜色","说明":"背景色"},{"键":"slab","默认":"#22406b","类型":"颜色","说明":"块体色"},{"键":"scan","默认":"#5fd0ff","类型":"颜色","说明":"扫描面色"},{"键":"inner","默认":"#ffce5a","类型":"颜色","说明":"截面高亮色"},{"键":"speed","默认":0.6,"类型":"数字","说明":"扫描推进占比(0-1)"},{"键":"dur","默认":7,"类型":"数字","说明":"周期(s)"},{"键":"radius","默认":10,"类型":"数字","说明":"圆角(px)"}],"效果说明":"半透明扫描面沿块体从左向右移动，截面方框随位置同步更新大小（中心截面最大），最后停在正中关键位并停顿，循环演示。自动播放，不依赖 hover。","用法":"展示沿方向查看内部截面、医学/工程断层扫描概念。","提示词":"让切面从左向右移动，同步更新截面，最后停在关键位置。用法：沿方向查看内部截面。关键参数：背景色、块体色、扫描面色、截面高亮色、扫描推进占比、周期、圆角。集成步骤：1 块体+网格；2 扫描面 translateX 推进，余下时间停在中心；3 截面方随距中心远近缩放。","代码":"\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"zh\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>切面扫描</title>\\n<style>\\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\\nbody{height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg,#0b1020);font-family:system-ui,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Arial,sans-serif}\\n:root{--bg:#0b1020;--slab:#22406b;--scan:#5fd0ff;--inner:#ffce5a;--speed:0.6;--dur:7;--radius:10}\\n.scene{width:300px;height:160px;transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:perspective(900px) rotateX(-8deg)}\\n.slab{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:300px;height:160px;border-radius:calc(var(--radius)*1px);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--slab) 85%,transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);overflow:hidden}\\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.12) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.12) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:24px 24px}\\n.scan{position:absolute;top:-6px;bottom:-6px;width:3px;background:var(--scan,#5fd0ff);box-shadow:0 0 18px var(--scan,#5fd0ff);left:0}\\n.section{position:absolute;left:0;top:50%;width:64px;height:64px;margin-top:-32px;margin-left:-32px;border:2px solid var(--inner,#ffce5a);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 0 16px var(--inner,#ffce5a)}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div class=\\\"scene\\\"><div class=\\\"slab\\\" id=\\\"slab\\\"><div class=\\\"grid\\\"></div><div class=\\\"section\\\" id=\\\"section\\\"></div><div class=\\\"scan\\\" id=\\\"scan\\\"></div></div></div>\\n<script>\\nconst state={\\\"bg\\\":\\\"#0b1020\\\",\\\"slab\\\":\\\"#22406b\\\",\\\"scan\\\":\\\"#5fd0ff\\\",\\\"inner\\\":\\\"#ffce5a\\\",\\\"speed\\\":0.6,\\\"dur\\\":7,\\\"radius\\\":10};\\nfunction apply(){const r=document.documentElement.style;r.setProperty(\\\"--bg\\\",state.bg);r.setProperty(\\\"--slab\\\",state.slab);r.setProperty(\\\"--scan\\\",state.scan);r.setProperty(\\\"--inner\\\",state.inner);r.setProperty(\\\"--speed\\\",state.speed);r.setProperty(\\\"--dur\\\",state.dur);r.setProperty(\\\"--radius\\\",state.radius);}\\nconst scan=document.getElementById(\\\"scan\\\"),section=document.getElementById(\\\"section\\\");const W=300;\\nfunction draw(t){const mf=Math.min(0.9,Math.max(0.1,state.speed));let x;if(t<mf){x=-20+(t/mf)*(W+40);}else{x=W/2;}scan.style.left=x+\\\"px\\\";section.style.left=x+\\\"px\\\";const d=Math.abs(x-W/2)/(W/2);const s=40+d*40;section.style.width=s+\\\"px\\\";section.style.height=s+\\\"px\\\";section.style.marginLeft=(-s/2)+\\\"px\\\";section.style.marginTop=(-s/2)+\\\"px\\\";}\\nconst reduce=matchMedia(\\\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\\\").matches;\\nfunction frame(now){const t=(now/1000/state.dur)%1;draw(t);if(!reduce)requestAnimationFrame(frame);}\\napply();if(reduce)draw(0.5);else requestAnimationFrame(frame);\\naddEventListener(\\\"message\\\",e=>{const d=e.data;if(!d||d.type!==\\\"param\\\")return;if(!(d.key in state))return;state[d.key]=d.value;apply();});\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"","适配端":"通用","元素":"动效","风格":"科技未来","场景":"官网·品牌站","来源":"④ 来自于抖音（用户收藏夹 modal_id=7687230787947815289）：6 个「立体结构展示动效」的 AI 提示词模板——分层拉开 / 零件爆炸展开 / 局部剖开 / 切面扫描 / 透视显露内部 / 路径装配；本库零依赖原生 CSS 3D 重实现（非搬运源码、无外链、无框架）；机制指纹（爆炸 / 剖开 / 切面 / 透视 / 装配 / 分层拉开）在库内 0 命中，属新机制，故入素材库","复用记录":""}