    "效果说明": "滑块拖到阈值（默认 85%）即锁定为已确认，否则回弹。用 pointer/mouse/touch 统一事件驱动，fill 宽度跟随手指，done 态变绿。阈值由 --threshold 参数控制，可改成任意百分比。",
    "用法": "确认类操作（签到、提交、授权）用它替代按钮；触发逻辑在 up 里判断 x>=max*th/100；回弹用 set(0)。",
    "提示词": "一个滑动确认控件，拖动到 85% 阈值锁定为已确认，否则回弹，移动端手势驱动。",
    "代码": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>滑动确认</title>\n<style>\n:root{--track:#e7e3da;--thumb:#d98a3d;--ok:#2e7d4f;--ink:#1c1c1c;--radius:24px;--threshold:85;--w:300}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\nbody{background:#f3f0ea;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:100vh;font-family:system-ui,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}\n.wrap{width:min(calc(var(--w)*1px),calc(100vw - 32px))}\n.slider{position:relative;height:54px;background:var(--track);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;user-select:none;touch-action:none}\n.fill{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:0;width:54px;background:var(--thumb);border-radius:var(--radius);transition:width .05s}\n.thumb{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #00000033;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--ink);font-size:20px;cursor:grab;z-index:2}\n.slider.done .fill{width:100%!important;background:var(--ok)}\n.label{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;pointer-events:none;opacity:.6}\n.slider.done .label{color:#ffffff;opacity:1}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"slider\" id=\"s\"><div class=\"fill\"></div><div class=\"label\" id=\"lab\">滑动确认</div><div class=\"thumb\" id=\"t\">›</div></div></div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var s=document.getElementById('s'),t=document.getElementById('t'),f=s.querySelector('.fill'),lab=document.getElementById('lab');\n  var max=s.clientWidth-54, drag=false, x=0;\n  var th=parseFloat(getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--threshold'))||85;\n  function set(p){x=Math.max(0,Math.min(max,p));t.style.left=x+'px';f.style.width=(x+54)+'px';}\n  function down(e){drag=true;move(e);}\n  function move(e){if(!drag)return;var cx=(e.touches?e.touches[0].clientX:e.clientX)-s.getBoundingClientRect().left-27;set(cx);}\n  function up(){if(!drag)return;drag=false;if(x>=max*th/100){s.classList.add('done');lab.textContent='已确认';t.style.left=max+'px';f.style.width='100%';}else{set(0);}}\n  t.addEventListener('mousedown',down);t.addEventListener('touchstart',down);\n  window.addEventListener('mousemove',move);window.addEventListener('touchmove',move);\n  window.addEventListener('mouseup',up);window.addEventListener('touchend',up);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "复用记录": ""
